[3369]={"You found an egg!","The chicken gives you a dirty look as you claim her egg for yourself","'Thanks! Set down the eggs over there. Now if you'll excuse me I have some goats to feed.\
\
'Once I find where they've gone. Oh dear....'","The chicken has no eggs and wishes you wouldn't put so much pressure on it to lay one","This chicken has two eggs. The guilty look in its eye suggests that one might be stolen","Tell Alagiel that you have checked all the chickens for eggs.","The chicken is busy and has no time to entertain your search for eggs","Collect eggs (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","Talk to Alagiel","Check the Chickens","A frazzled farmer needs help looking after her livestock.","'I have much too much to do. If you have experience being a farmhand I would welcome your help.\
\
'I need you to check the chickens to see if they have laid any eggs. I promised Old Grathir I would deliver him half a dozen eggs but with all my other work I don't have time to chase down my birds.'","Alagiel has asked you to check the chickens of Lothgobel for eggs."},
[3370]={"The frog traps can be found in the marshes of the delta west of Iridír.","'Where do you hail from, ${PLAYER}? Is it far? I am a bit of a traveller myself. I was not born in Iridír. I am from Eshadûr, all the way across the river. It was once a busy fishing village, but now the Ordâkhai have taken it for themselves and told me I must go elsewhere.\
\
'But to tell you the truth, fishing from the north side of the river is not so different. There are just as many frogs here as there were in Eshadûr. Ambarûli love their frog legs! I catch them using traps. It is much easier than chasing them around with a net, like a fool!\
\
'Speaking of which, would you mind checking my frog traps? Why yes, I am trying to get you to do more of my work. Am I succeeding? They are in the marshes of the delta to the west. Go ahead. It will be fun.'","Bring the frogs to Zildug in Iridír","You have collected all the frogs from the traps. You should bring them to Zildug in Iridír.","This trap is empty","Zildug has asked you to check his frog traps and bring him what you find.","'Would you mind checking my frog traps? They are in the marshes of the delta west of Iridír. Go ahead. It will be fun.'","'Six frogs is not bad! That is twelve legs, after all. Thank you, ${PLAYER}. You are very kind.'","Collected frogs (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Collect frogs from the traps (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Checking for Frogs"},
[3372]={"Talk to Sûlmur","'Thank you for your help, ${PLAYER}. I dislike asking for aid, but I am glad that I did. If your travels happen to be taking you east, I would ask one last thing of you. There is a papyrus farm just east, along the river's edge.'\
\
The man's face turns beet red.\
\
'There is a young lady there, Sûlmur, who does some rather dangerous work. The papyrus bogs are rife with crocodiles and zizani. I think you would call them Neekers? It would bring me comfort if you could visit and see that she fares well. Thank you, friend. And good luck on your travels.'","'There is a young lady, Sûlmur, who works at the papyrus farm to the east. The papyrus bogs are rife with crocodiles and zizani. It would bring me comfort if you could visit and see that she fares well.'","'Oh, Hashtal-gûr, stranger. Turizi sent you to see if I am well?'\
\
She blushes.\
\
'I am as well as can be expected, I suppose. How is Turizi?'\
\
You tell her that he is well. Perhaps a bit stubborn, but not too stubborn to ask someone for help when he needs it. The woman laughs.\
\
'That sounds like a welcome improvement!'","Checking on the Neighbours","Turizi would like you to check on the welfare of Sûlmur at her papyrus farm in Ambarûl, east of Ekagar.","Turizi has asked if you wouldn't mind visiting a neighbouring papyrus farm."},
[3373]={"Derrota a Maestros arqueros Tarkrîp (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'No podemos retrasar más esta investigación. Los orcos ya han demostrado ser más ingeniosos de lo que esperábamos. Si se organizan rápidamente en los campos del norte de las Tierras de Bree, no hay forma de saber hasta dónde viajarán hacia el sur.\
\
'Investiga la cresta sur de la garganta hacia el norte.'","Aplastahuesos Tarkrîp derrotados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Derrota a Aplastahuesos Tarkrîp (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Está hecho entonces. Los orcos deben haber invadido los valles de las Quebradas del Norte. Las fronteras han sido vulneradas.\
\
'Debemos enviar una advertencia a mis hermanos por todas partes. Tus esfuerzos son de gran importancia, ${PLAYER}.'","Se te ha ordenado buscar hacia el este, a lo largo de la garganta, muy al norte de los campos de Bree, más allá de la Granja Hengstacer, para encontrar a un líder orco y su séquito.\
\
Andreg teme que los orcos se hayan adentrado demasiado en las Tierras de Bree, aunque solo un pequeño número pasó por Puente de Caballetes. Esto le preocupa mucho. Te envió a investigar y a asestar un golpe contra los orcos.","El descubrimiento de orcos en las Tierras de Bree ha preocupado a Andreg, el Montaraz.","Derrota a Gazbúrz","Habla con Andreg en el Viejo Fuerte del Camino Verde","'Necesito que vayas hacia el norte, más allá de la Granja Hengstacer y por las tierras donde los cazadores se ganan la vida. Si encontraste un pequeño grupo de exploradores orcos justo fuera de la Granja Hengstacer y aún más acampados en el borde sur de la garganta, entonces temo que un campamento mayor puede haberse instalado en las ruinas del este, cerca de los lagos del norte de las Tierras de Bree.\
\
'Ve allí y busca al líder de los orcos y a sus secuaces. Derrótalos, si puedes, y regresa para que sepa que la tarea está cumplida. Si encuentras un campamento allí... entonces sabremos que las Quebradas del Norte han caído.\
\
'Por favor, date prisa.'","Andreg está en el Viejo Fuerte del Camino Verde.\
\
Debes regresar con Andreg y contarle sobre el campamento orco que descubriste a lo largo de la garganta, en los confines más septentrionales de las Tierras de Bree.","Comprobando las fronteras","Maestros arqueros Tarkrîp derrotados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Gazbúrz derrotado"},
[3374]={"Checking the Traps","Collect Saithe from fishing traps (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Have you set foot upon those lovely islands out there? No sense just going out there to look around though. You must have a reason, I tell you. I have some traps out there. If you go out there to look around, check the traps for me. Then you will be living like me. One with the sea. Aye, that is the only life I want.'","'Well will you look at that? Quite the haul, I do say. I must bring you out on a boat with me some time. You, my friend, are good luck!'","Haldil, a local at the Cape Docks, enjoys working on the shore and on the water.","La trampa está vacía","Fish traps can be found around the shores of either of the Cape islands.\
\
You should check the traps for fish.","Haldil is down by the Cape Docks.\
\
You should speak to Haldil when you have a moment.","Collected Saithe (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Talk to Haldil"},
[3375]={"Carrera de Gallina","Te han engañado. Parece que esta gallina estaba destinada a ser la cena de las fuerzas de Angmar. Salva tu pellejo y llega a Glân Vraig.","¡Has sobrevivido!","Sobrevive al viaje hasta Glân Vraig.","Llega a las afueras de Glân Vraig"},
[3376]={"Colocas al pollo en el suelo y este intenta escapar de nuevo, aunque sin éxito","Recupera el segundo pollo escapado","Habla con Mushêndu fuera del corral de los pollos.","Recupera el primer pollo escapado","'Me alegra que hayas podido ayudar a Mushêndu. Me han enviado a traerte de regreso a Urmâkh, hay otros asuntos allí que requieren tu atención.'","Colocas al pollo en el suelo, seguro dentro del corral de Mushêndu, y le das una charla seria sobre quedarse adentro","Recupera el tercer pollo escapado","Habla con Mushêndu","Recupera los pollos escapados de Mushêndu.","'Gracias. Otros hablan de mejorar Urmâkh, pero tú realmente estás haciendo algo al respecto. Gracias por encontrar todos mis pollos y devolverlos a salvo, es un gran alivio.'","Recupera el cuarto pollo escapado","Encuentra al explorador","Encuentra al explorador.","'Hashtal-gûr, ${PLAYERNAME:amigo[m]|amiga[f]}. Me alegra que finalmente hayan enviado a alguien. Estas piernas no son tan ágiles y frescas como antes. Es difícil subir y bajar estas colinas. Mis pollos se han escapado de nuevo. Lo único para lo que parecen tener talento. Debe haber gusanos más jugosos al otro lado de la cerca. Sin embargo, son unos malditos tontos, hay chacales que merodean por estas colinas. Pocas cosas son una comida tan buena para esas bestias como un pollo.\
\
¿Podrías reunirlos antes de que les pueda pasar algo malo?'","Colocas al pollo en el suelo y le dices que se mantenga alejado de los chacales. Te parpadea","Colocas al pollo en el suelo y este asiente ligeramente en señal de agradecimiento. O quizás vio un gusano en la tierra","Un granjero local fuera de Urmâkh ha pedido ayuda para reunir sus pollos escapados.","Habla con el granjero Mushêndu.","Pollos de vuelta al gallinero","Habla con el granjero Mushêndu","Cierras la puerta detrás de ti. Los pollos intercambian una mirada significativa, quizás planeando su próxima escapada"},
[3377]={"Toca el cuerno de invocación en Barad Morlas y derrota a Horngoth.","El cuerno de invocación se encuentra al pie norte de un puente en Barad Morlas, al suroeste de Echad Eregion.\
\
Lengliel te ha pedido que uses el cuerno de invocación de Barad Morlas para desafiar a Horngoth, el líder de los semiorcos de allí.","Lengliel te pidió que reunieras varios estandartes de la Mano Blanca y se los llevaras. Gracias a ellos, ha podido averiguar la identidad del líder de los semiorcos.","'¿Ves este letrero? Quizás tu ojo no esté entrenado para verlo. Este estandarte nombra a Horngoth, un semiorco de pésima reputación, como el líder de estas fuerzas.\
\
'Viaja ahora a Barad Morlas. Al pie norte de un puente que conduce más adentro de las ruinas, encontrarás un cuerno de invocación, similar al de Pembar. Sopla el cuerno y seguramente Horngoth responderá.\
\
'El puente se encuentra al suroeste de aquí. ¡Date prisa!'","'Los semiorcos de Barad Morlas están desorganizados ahora, pero creo que podrían pedir refuerzos...'","Lengliel está en Echad Eregion, al noreste de Barad Morlas.\
\
Debes regresar con Lengliel y contarle sobre tu victoria en Barad Morlas.","Horngoth derrotado","Jefe de los invasores","'¡Encuentra el cuerno de invocación en Barad Morlas, al suroeste de aquí, y úsalo para desafiar a Horngoth!'","'Es bueno que hayas derrotado a Horngoth, pero su derrota podría atraer a más enemigos. Nuestros exploradores nos informan de que hay más sirvientes de la Mano Blanca en los pasos de la Puerta del Cuerno Rojo y Nan Sirannon.'","Habla con Lengliel en Echad Eregion"},
[3378]={"Caudillo Gûrsh","'Los exploradores informaron de que habían visto a un uruk extraño y oyeron a los capataces orcos a su mando gritar \\qcaudillo Gûrsh\\q mientras se alejaba a zancadas hacia la Biblioteca de Tham Mírdain. Parece que hemos identificado al líder de esta campaña bélica de Angmar, y ahora debemos hacer todo lo posible para acabar con esta amenaza.\
\
'Te pediría que entraras en la Biblioteca de Tham Mírdain y desafiaras a Gûrsh a un combate. Si consigues sacarlo de su escondite y derrotarlo, habremos eliminado de hecho al líder de las fuerzas del norte.\
\
'Sin embargo, debemos tener cuidado de no atraer la atención de los orcos y los dunlendinos del sur, pues no tenemos fuerzas para combatir al norte y al sur si de repente unieran sus fuerzas. Cuanto más sigilosos seamos, mayores serán nuestras posibilidades de vencer a todos los enemigos. Reúne a no más de dos compañeros para este asalto, pues nuestra esperanza reside en el secreto. Antes de lanzar el asalto, deberías hablar con Maegamiel.'","Derrota al caudillo Gûrsh","Has derrotado al caudillo Gûrsh","El caudillo Gûrsh, líder de las fuerzas del norte de Angmar, se encuentra en la Biblioteca de Tham Mírdain, justo al suroeste de Echad Mirobel.\
\
Ornras, de Echad Mirobel, te ha pedido que reúnas a un pequeño grupo de combatientes y derroques al caudillo Gûrsh, con la esperanza de que esto debilite la presencia enemiga del norte sin llamar la atención del sur. Los enemigos han estado rebuscando en la Biblioteca en busca de historia olvidada que pueda ser útil para su causa."},
[3379]={"Defeated Henmaru","'There have always been dark legends about the Wódfen, and your tale bears them out. I wonder why the Dead have awakened now?\
\
'It is no matter. You have done us a service by destroying their chieftain.'","Searching for the source of the madness that has befallen the creatures of the marsh, you tracked the draugar to a cave in the Wódfen.","The draug-chieftain probably dwells somewhere in the depths of their cave.\
\
You should hunt for the draug-chieftain and put an end to its existence.","There are Rohirrim at Eaworth, south of the Wódfen.\
\
You should bring news of your victory against Henmaru to the Rohirrim.","Talk to someone at Eaworth","Searching for the source of the madness that has befallen the creatures of the marsh, you tracked the draugar to a cave in the Wódfen.\
\
You should enter Byrgenstow and defeat the chieftain of the draugar.","Somewhere in the depths of Byrgenstow, the ruler of the draugar dwells","Chieftain of the Dead","Defeat Henmaru"},
[3381]={"Speak to someone in Malbarth about travelling east","DNT -- will not be seen","Children of the Sisters","Erianir of Sarnhad has begged you to travel north to Malbarth before journeying east to Ost Anglebed for fear of the growing Corsair and Haradrim force on the coast.","Malbarth can be found to the north of Sarnhad in western Lebennin.\
\
Erianir has asked you to travel north to Malbarth before journeying east in Lebennin as the Corsair and Haradrim forces have seized much of the eastern lands.","'You say you have come from Sarnhad?\
\
'I am glad it has not yet met with a grim fate as so many others have... I saw the smoke rising this morn, but could not tell which of our settlements had fallen to the Corsairs.'","'You have been of great help to us, my friend, but one of your skill would do well to join our forces to the east.\
\
'However, the Corsairs and Haradrim have seized much of the land to the east and the road is unsafe for travel. I would beg that you travel north through Malbarth before journeying east to the beacon-settlement of Ost Anglebed. The hearty folk that dwell there can provide you safe passage to the east.\
\
'Our guards in Ost Anglebed and Pelargir are all that remain, so your aid could be vital. Go swiftly, my friend, and let us hope we see you again in brighter times.'"},
[3382]={"Tumularios glaciales","Los muertos ancestrales se han alzado en el Gran Túmulo.","Derrota a tumularios glaciales (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Tumularios glaciales derrotados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Los tumularios glaciales se pueden encontrar en el ala inundada del Gran Túmulo."},
[3383]={"Los campamentos gauradan están al sur de la morada de Thorgest.\
\
Thorgest te ha pedido que registres los campamentos de los Gauredain con la esperanza de encontrar algún remedio para el mal que le aflige.","'Parece que... que al final los hombres-lobo han podido conmigo....\
\
'Siento el cuerpo frío como la piedra, y ni siquiera este fuego rugiente me da calor. Sus invocadores espirituales me han echado una maldición, o esa flecha llevaba algún tipo de veneno... no sé cuál de las dos cosas es.\
\
'No tengo conocimientos de curación más allá de entablillar huesos y vendar cortes, ni mis sentidos están claros ahora. Si es veneno o maldición, quizá encuentres algo en los campamentos de los Gauradan que pueda curarlo... por favor, te lo ruego, ve a ver qué puedes hallar, aunque poco consejo puedo darte sobre lo que podría servirme.'","'¿Qué es esto? Yo... no sé qué hacer con ello.\
\
'No tengo el saber necesario para ayudarme. Si no has encontrado algún modo de curarme entre sus pertenencias, entonces se ha ido mi última esperanza.\
\
'Perdóname, no me queda fuerza alguna... debo dormir y confiar en que el destino me permita despertar de nuevo. Ojalá mi hermano siguiera aquí para velar por mí...'","Frío hasta los Huesos","Cestas gauradan registradas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Registra cestas gauradan (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Thorgest parece haber caído gravemente enfermo por las armas envenenadas de los Gauredain.","'¿Has encontrado ya algo que pueda sugerir una cura para mí?'","La morada de Thorgest está al norte de los campamentos gauradan.\
\
Debes llevar a Thorgest las reliquias gauradan que hayas recogido para ver si puede hallar una cura entre ellas."},
[3384]={"Gather a sample of dragon horn","'Yes, yes. These will do quite well! I shall begin to study them immediately!'","'Ah, ${PLAYER}! I see you made it all this way in one piece. I could not resist the opportunity to come to Elderslade, a landscape full of cold-drakes and even better – dragon bones!\
\
'Though we dwarves have a long history with the beasts, there is still much that we don’t know. While you are out on the field, it would really help my studies if you could gather samples from the various remains that are scattered about.'","Gather a sample of dragon spine","Gather a sample of dragon tooth","Lore-master Rúni is at Zudramdân in Elderslade.\
\
You should bring the dragon samples to Lore-master Rúni.","Return to Rúni","'Though we have records of the great beasts, being able to study their bones could give us much information.'","Chipping the Bones","Dragon skeletons can be found in Malkorlash, in northern Elderslade.\
\
Lore-master Rúni has asked you to get samples of dragon bones.","Scattered across Elderslade, the sun-bleached bones of great worms are a harsh reminder of the dragons that once prowled these mountains. What secrets might these skeletons hold?","Gather a sample of dragon claw","Gather a sample of dragon rib"},
[3386]={"Rascacuevas derrotados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Derrota rascacuevas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Serric has asked you to reduce the cave-claw infestation in the nearby mountains.\
\
Cave-claws have been spotted at the foot of the mountainside west of Ost Arndír.","You should let Serric know that you have lessened the number of cave-claws at Rasping-crag.\
\
Serric is in Ost Arndír.","Chitterings at Rasping-crag","Return to Serric","'Someone needs to do something! I just got back from trying to gather firewood in the woods west of the city and you will not believe what I found. Cave-claws! They've burst through the mountainside and are infesting the forest. Someone needs to take care of those vermin before they multiply! Before they come down into Ost Arndír itself!'\
\
Serric shudders at the thought and looks at you impatiently.","'You did it? Oh, thank you so much. Ugh, those creatures make my stomach turn.'","Chittering and feral growls have been heard in a once-quiet forest outside of Ost Arndír."},
[3388]={"The time has come to choose your clan allegiance. All you need do is speak with one of the emissaries and choose to represent them on the field of battle.","Choose a clan and receive their blessing","Having met the emissaries of the clans, you must now make a decision. What clan shall you represent in the conflict of the Ettenmoors?","Choose Wisely","'This choice is an important one, for certain. But as the master has deemed, you can freely choose what clan you shall represent in the battle for a time.\
\
'You should feel free to approach whichever tribe you choose without fear that you must always represent that clan. No, little worm, you can freely change your allegiances the same as you choose your diet for a day.'\
\
She offers you a weak smile.\
\
'Simply choose an emissary and accept their blessing. If you decide later that you dislike the benefits that their clan provides I am certain that they will abide by the master's law and allow you to freely choose your clan affiliation for now.\
\
'Was that word too big for you? You seem to be staring at me more slack-jawed than usual. Perhaps, you should go make your choice.'"},
[3390]={"Totâkhri chilla, ¡dejando escapar un agudo grito de batalla!","Retoños extraños quemados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Totâkhri cae, crujiendo mientras su corteza se parte y se agrieta","Encuentra y derrota a Totâkhri, la Raíz Podrida.","Quema los extraños retoños (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Derrota a los Ucornos en la Arboleda Muerta (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Ucornos derrotados en la Arboleda Muerta (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Derrota a los Ucornos en la afectada Arboleda Muerta y quema sus retoños.","'Esta arboleda me llena de desesperación. Anhelo que vuelva a ser exuberante y verde, ojalá vuelva a la salud pronto.'","La podredumbre de Adagím se está extendiendo. Amenaza con traer la plaga a Kighân. Corta los árboles inquietos y quema la plaga en la Arboleda Muerta.","Encuentra y derrota a Totâkhri, la Raíz Podrida","Cortar el bosque"},
[3391]={"Se han terminado todas las tareas para preparar la granja para el mercado.","Tareas terminadas","Albin Cotonorte está en la zona del mercado.\
\
Albin Cotonorte querrá saber que todas las tareas están terminadas y que la granja está lista.","'¿Así que la granja está en un estado presentable? Habíamos estado ignorando esas tareas durante semanas. Me impresiona que las hayas terminado tan rápido.'","'¡Las tareas por fin están terminadas!'","Habla con Albin Cotonorte","'Has hecho un buen trabajo ayudándome, ¡y creo que la granja está lista para el mercado!\
\
'Las herramientas están guardadas, las malas hierbas arrancadas, los espantapájaros en su sitio y las flores plantadas... ¡No se me ocurre nada más que pueda hacer!\
\
'Por favor, avisa a Albin Cotonorte de que las tareas están terminadas.'"},
[3404]={"Chronicling the Blight: Flora","You have gathered samples of the blighted flora outside of Sul Madásh. Return the samples you collected to Serâna.","Gather blighted flora samples (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Bighted flora samples gathered (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Serâna has asked for you gather samples of the blighted flora near Sul Madásh so that she can study them and see how the rot affects different plants.","'The plants are reacting strangely to the blight in recent days.'\
\
Serâna fumbles with a leaf in her hands as she inspects markings on it.\
\
'I wish to study these further. If you are willing, ${CLASS}, I ask that you gather samples of the flora that has been affected by the blight near Sul Madásh and return them to me.'","Return the flora samples to Serâna","'Good to see you again. Were you able to get the samples of which I spoke?'\
\
You give the flora samples to Serâna and she begins fumbling with the leaves of them.\
\
'Curious. They seem to react to the rot inside them differently in some cases.\
\
'My fellow scholar, Râjoron, is in Sâr Marsag to the south. I wonder if he has found similar results.\
\
'Thank you, my friend.'"},
[3405]={"Gather insect samples (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Greetings, ${CLASS}. I need more samples to bring to Zajâna for study.\
\
'The blight is growing stronger here, and I have seen that the insects of the area are succumbing to it in unusual ways.\
\
'I ask that you gather samples for me from the area. You can find them in swarms near the water's edge.'","Insect samples gathered (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","You gathered insects from the marsh waters outside of Sul Madásh. Return the samples you collected to Serâna.","'You have returned. Were you able to gather samples of the insects in the marsh?'\
\
You give Serâna the insect samples you gathered and she makes a face when she takes them.\
\
'These are perfect. I will study these further and chronicle what I find.\
\
'What disgusting little creatures they are. I do so dislike insects. They make my skin crawl, but the work must be done.'","Chronicling the Blight: Insects","Return the insect samples to Serâna","Serâna has asked for you search the waters near Sul Madásh and gather insects found there so that she can study them for signs of blight."},
[3406]={"Serâna has asked for your help gathering sap from the trees outside of Sul Madásh so that she can study the blight within them.","Chronicling the Blight: Sap","You found blighted sap within the trees outside of Sul Madásh. Return the samples you collected to Serâna.","'The trees of Sul Madásh are dying.'\
\
Serâna examines the tree sap in her hand.\
\
'${CLASS}, I ask for your help in gathering sap from the trees in the surrounding area and bringing it to me, so that I can study the blight within them. I fear Sul Madásh is not as safe as we hoped.'","Return the sap samples to Serâna","'These samples are exactly what I needed.'\
\
Serâna takes the samples from you and inspects them more closely.\
\
'I must make notes of these findings. Thank you for your assistance, ${CLASS}.'","Tree sap gathered (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Gather tree sap (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[3407]={"Derrota a las criaturas en la Gran Rueda (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'¿Así que la encontraste? \
\
Estoy impresionado. Muchos habrían sucumbido a las aguas o a las criaturas de las profundidades. Te agradezco mucho tu ayuda.'","Ansurr se encuentra en Hulwul-nefekh, al noreste de la Gran Rueda.\
\
Ansurr estará encantado de saber que has localizado la rueda de agua y que has eliminado a las criaturas cercanas.","'¿Has oído un gran crujido y un batir en tus viajes por las Obras Hidráulicas? Ese sonido proviene de una de las antiguas ruedas de agua que una vez alimentaron las grandes forjas de Khazad-dûm. Sin esas ruedas, las forjas se sobrecalentarían, y todos los enanos habrían quemado y encontrado su fin.\
\
Sin embargo, no todas las ruedas siguen funcionando. La Gran Rueda ha estado inactiva durante mucho tiempo, y es hora de renovar su batir. Si puedes, haznos un favor y expulsa a algunas de las criaturas del área. Si vamos a reavivar las forjas, primero necesitaremos controlar las ruedas.\
\
Las ruedas de agua se pueden encontrar cerca de la Gran Rueda, al suroeste de aquí.'","Encuentra la antigua rueda de agua","Habla con Ansurr en Hulwul-nefekh","Las ruedas de agua de Moria fueron una vez fundamentales para alimentar y enfriar los grandes fuegos de las antiguas forjas.","Las ruedas de agua se encuentran en la Gran Rueda, al suroeste de Hulwul-nefekh.\
\
Ansurr te ha pedido que encuentres una gran rueda de agua que ya no funciona, cerca de las Obras Hidráulicas. Una vez que la hayas encontrado, elimina a las criaturas cercanas para asegurarla.","Espuma agitada","Criaturas derrotadas en la Gran Rueda (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Una gran rueda de agua yace quieta en el agua cercana","'Las ruedas de agua se encuentran al suroeste. Si vamos a reavivar las forjas, las ruedas deben estar bajo nuestro control.'"},
[3408]={"Return to Thornaran and tell him you successfully defeated Orcs in Minas Morgul.","Two forces of Orcs are fortifying the outer ring of Minas Morgul. Thornaran has asked you to defeat warriors in either camp.","Defeated Orcs in the Circle of Wrath (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Talk to Thornaran","'You defeated Orcs from one of the armies in the Circle of Wrath, or dare I hope... from both? I am pleased to hear it, and to offer you my thanks.'","Defeat Orcs from either army in the Circle of Wrath (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Two Orc armies inhabit the Circle of Wrath in Minas Morgul.\
\
You should venture forth and defeat Orcs from either army.","'Hail to you, and well-met! Our position in the city is a precarious one, and I hope you will be able to help us keep it! The outer ring of Minas Morgul is inhabited by two different armies of Orcs, and each of them stands in the way of the work we must do.\
\
'Would you defeat troops from either encampment as you encounter them, thereby helping us ensure we can accomplish our mission here? Good, good!'","Circle of Wrath: Culling the Troops"},
[3409]={"Defeat one of Gothmog's captains in Zhar Dushgoi","Defeated one of Gothmog's captains","Return to Thornaran and inform him that you defeated an Orc captain in Zhar Dushgoi.","Circle of Wrath: Gothmog's Captain","Talk to Thornaran","A powerful host of Orcs makes camp within Zhar Dushgoi.\
\
You should seek out one of the captains in Zhar Dushgoi and defeat him.","'You did very well, my friend! Those Orcs are sure to miss that captain. Please accept my thanks.'","'East of here lies Zhar Dushgoi, an Orc encampment that has proven quite a thorn in our side already. Within that camp, several captains serve to keep their subordinates in line. Would you venture into the area and defeat one of the captains? I do not care which! Any of them will do!'","Zhar Dushgoi lies east of Barad Angarth in the outer ring of Minas Morgul. Thornaran asked you to seek out and defeat its Orc captains."},
[3414]={"La mirada del enemigo","Recoge ojos de craban (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Candaith te ha explicado que los crebain que sobrevuelan la región del Monte Ventoso no son inocentes aves, sino criaturas maléficas enviadas para espiar estas tierras. Para asegurarte de que no regresen a informar a sus amos de lo que han visto, hay que matarlos y arrancarles los ojos.","'Si los crebain encuentran lo que buscan sus amos, será imposible predecir la magnitud de la invasión que sufrirán estas tierras. Debemos hacer todo lo posible para que eso no suceda.'","Los crebain se pueden encontrar por todas las Colinas de los Vientos. El campamento de Candaith está al pie de la Cima de los Vientos, en las Tierras Solitarias.\
\
Candaith te ha encargado que busques y destruyas a los crebain que se encuentran en las inmediaciones de su campamento. Él cree que están aquí por orden de algún amo invisible y que informarán de todo lo que han visto.","Lleva los ojos de craban a Candaith.","'Estas tierras se han vuelto muy oscuras en los últimos días. Desde la época en que paseaba por los confines de las Tierras Solitarias, una sombra negra ha comenzado a oscurecer el cielo. Hoy en día, esa sombra se extiende de este a oeste, buscando algo para sus amos.\
\
Me refiero a los crebain. Estas viles criaturas tienen una inteligencia superior a la que deberían tener y debemos hacer todo lo posible para detenerlas. Mátalas y recógeles los ojos, es la única forma de asegurarnos de que no informen a sus amos de lo que han visto.\
\
Las encontrarás por todas partes en las Colinas de los Vientos.'","Ojos de craban recolectados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Sé que esta misión no ha sido nada agradable, pero era necesaria. Los crebain son espías enviados desde lejos que buscan algo concreto por aquí. Con todo lo que he visto últimamente, me temo que se está tramando algo y espero que nuestros esfuerzos contribuyan a frenar su avance.\
\
Gracias por tu ayuda, ${PLAYER}."},
[3417]={"'Spend your gold leaves and silver branches wisely!'","'I hope you are enjoying your time here, friend ${CLASS}.'","'Climb this ladder to reach the higher level and speak with my friend Padril, for she will conclude your tour of Telain Galadhrim.'","Randiron is in Telain Galadhrim, beneath the flet on which the trainers reside, down the western path and along the first right turn.\
\
Trevadiel told you to seek Randiron to learn more of the ways of Caras Galadhon.","'Telain Galadhrim is above us, at the top of these winding steps.'","Talk to Rainen at Telain Galadhrim","'This ladder will take you up to the Elves of my kin who grant bartering rewards.'","'We are beneath Telain Galadhrim, the flets upon which the class trainers reside. Climb these winding steps up to the flets and speak with Rainen, who will continue your tour of the city.'","'On this high flet of Telain Galadhrim you will find those of my kin entrusted with the rewarding of valuable items to those who have proven themselves true friends of the Elves of Lórien.\
\
'Bring any Lothlórien gold leaves or Lothlórien silver branches to the Elves on this flet for your rewards.\
\
'I hope you will enjoy your stay in Caras Galadhon, ${PLAYER}, and that you will be a valuable contributor to the good welfare of Lothlórien! Namárië!'","City of the Golden Wood","'On this level of Telain Galadhrim, you will find the Elves who grant bartering rewards.'","'How are you enjoying Caras Galadhon, ${PLAYER}?'","'Welcome, ${PLAYER}, to Caras Galadhon, beloved city of Lord Celeborn and Lady Galadriel of Lothlórien! Count yourself among the fortunate few, friend ${CLASS}, for not many outsiders have seen the beauty of this place and could report of it. What make you of Caras Galadhon thus far?\
\
'You wonder how you will find your way among the tall mallorn-trees? It is not as confusing as it may seem at first, my friend, and I will help you to learn your way around.\
\
'To reach Telain Galadhrim, the flets upon which the trainers reside, follow this path to the west and take the first right turning. Follow that path to my friend Randiron, who will guide you further.'","Talk to Randiron near Telain Galadhrim","Talk to Padril at Telain Galadhrim","Padril can be found at Telain Galadhrim, on the level above Rainen, reached by climbing the ladder.\
\
Rainen has asked you to speak with her friend Padril.","'On this level of Telain Galadhrim, you will find the class trainers.'","'It is my pleasure to welcome newcomers to Caras Galadhon, rare as it is.'","'These winding steps will take you to the flets of Telain Galadhrim.'","Rainen is at Telain Galadhrim, the flet upon which the trainers reside, up the winding steps from Randiron.\
\
Randiron has told you to speak with his friend Rainen.","'Many of the services you might need in Caras Galadhon can be found here at Telain Galadhrim.\
\
'On this level you will find the class trainers, a vault-keeper and our hall of trade. If you cross the flet to the ladder on the far side and climb the ladder there, you will find a mailbox for your use. On that level you will find vendors for the scholarly and jewelsmithy pursuits, as well as a healer and provisioner.\
\
'But for now, climb this ladder here to reach the next level and speak with Padril on the level above.'","'To reach Telain Galadhrim, follow this path to the west and take the first right turning. Follow that path to my friend Randiron, who will guide you further.'","'Climb these steps to reach Telain Galadhrim, where you will find many services.'","'The vault-keeper has a residence on this level of Telain Galadhrim.'","Trevadiel has welcomed you to Caras Galadhon and wants you to become familiar with the city.","'When Trevadiel heard there would be another visitor to Caras Galadhon, she hurried to the entrance with all haste; she delights in greeting those unfamiliar to the city, and there are so very few of those that she rarely has the opportunity.\
\
'Look above us, and you will see Telain Galadhrim, a series of flets upon which Elves of the many professions can be consulted for guidance and services. Climb the steps that wind up the bole of the tree here to reach the talan upon which the class trainers reside.\
\
'You will find Rainen on the flet above, and she will continue your tour of the city.'"},
[3418]={"City of the Prince","'You have done much to aid us, ${PLAYER}... so much so that I wish for you to travel to Dol Amroth. The people there would be well-served to have a skilful ${RACE} at their side.\
\
'The city is a wonder all its own, and if you have never visited it... prepare yourself. It is my opinion that you would be hard-pressed to find a place of greater beauty in Gondor, save perhaps Minas Tirith. I have said enough of the city... it is time you saw it for yourself!\
\
'Go, and seek a guard near the eastern gate - I can hardly keep up with all of the postings lately, so simply tell them I sent you.'","Heartened by your victories in Edhellond, Gilanor seeks your aid in protecting the great city of Dol Amroth.","DNT -- will not be seen","The city of Dol Amroth can be found to the west of Ost Lontir.\
\
Gilanor has asked you to offer your services to the people of Dol Amroth.","'Ah, so Gilanor sent you? Good man, that one.\
\
'Allow me to welcome you to Dol Amroth, the city of the Prince! You will have ample time to explore, I assure you, so for now, let us speak of other things.'","Talk to a guard outside the eastern gate of Dol Amroth"},
[3421]={"Roibeard se encuentra en los campamentos angmarim cerca del Umbral de Hierro, al noreste de Pynti-peldot.\
\
Esko te ha dicho dónde los Angmarim mantienen la Joya de Hielo. Debes recuperarlo antes de que pueda ser devuelto a las cámaras de Angmar.","Has recuperado la Joya de Hielo","'Debes encontrar el Jä-koru, ${PLAYER}. El tiempo se agota y pronto se nos escapará para siempre…'","Recuperar la joya","'Las órdenes que capturaste a los Angmarim han aclarado varias cosas. En efecto, los Angmarim poseen el Jä-koru, pero no tienen intención de entregarlo hasta que Forochel quede firmemente bajo su control.\
\
'No obstante, para acallar las dudas del Hylje-heimo, recientemente se vieron obligados a traer el Jä-koru a Forochel para demostrar su reclamación. Ahora es el momento de atacar y recuperar el Jä-koru antes de que lo devuelvan a alguna cámara oscura de Angmar. Está bajo la custodia de uno de sus capitanes de mayor confianza, un hombre llamado Roibeard. Ha establecido su campamento en algún lugar dentro de las fortificaciones del Umbral de Hierro.\
\
'Debo pedirte que te infiltres en esa fortaleza por cualquier medio posible y le arrebates el Jä-koru.'","Lleva la Joya de Hielo a Esko en Pynti-peldot","Esko te ha dicho que el Hylje-heimo podría inclinarse a apoyar a los Pueblos Libres del Sur si se recupera la Joya de Hielo.","Recoge la Joya de Hielo","'¿De verdad puede ser? Pensábamos que el destino nos había maldecido y que nunca volveríamos a verlo, ¡pero realmente lo has traído de vuelta… el Jä-koru!\
\
'${PLAYER}, tu nombre perdurará en canciones e historias durante muchas generaciones como el de quien nos devolvió nuestro mayor tesoro.'"},
[3422]={"Pálmar se encuentra en Anazârmekhem, al noreste de las forjas de Khazad-dûm.\
\
Ayudaste a Raf y a Sigir con sus tareas y ahora debes hablar con Pálmar para ganarte su favor ante Narfi.","Ayuda a Sigir en sus esfuerzos de recuperación","Ayuda a Raf a expulsar a los uruks de las forjas","Reclamando el pasado","Habla con Pálmar en Anazârmekhem","Raf y Sigir están en Anazârmekhem.\
\
Pálmar te pidió que hablaras con Raf y Sigir y que les ayudaras a despejar las forjas de Khazad-dûm.","Las forjas de Khazad-dûm fueron en su día el corazón herrero de Moria. Aquí, los inigualables herreros enanos trabajaban el mithril y forjaban sus mayores maravillas. Desde su caída, las forjas de Khazad-dûm se han visto inundadas por enormes aludes de lava y pobladas por los orcos de Moria y sus trols y trasgos. Aquí, el ejército orco trabaja sin cesar, construyendo armas y máquinas de asedio en preparación para la guerra contra Lothlórien.","'Sí, Raf y Sigir dijeron que demostraste ser ${PLAYER:un aliado[m]|una aliada[f]} muy ${PLAYER:dispuesto[m]|dispuesta[f]} y capaz. Tenemos la suerte de contar con gente como tú para ayudarnos.\
\
'Si no fuera por ti, los orcos podrían haber desplegado más armas de las que hubiéramos podido manejar y una fuerza completamente armada y blindada habría arrasado el Valle del Arroyo Sombrío.\
\
'La fortuna nos sonríe ya que no será el caso. Te doy las gracias, y le he enviado un mensaje a Narfi informándole de tu lealtad y honestidad. Te damos las gracias, ${PLAYER}.'","'Las Forjas no están a nuestro alcance por ahora... pero las recuperaremos algún día, y no hay mejor momento para empezar que el presente.\
\
'Raf y Sigir, mis dos ayudantes, necesitan ayuda para despejar las forjas. Puedes encontrarlos aquí en Anazârmekhem. Habla con ellos, infórmate de los deberes que tienen, y cuando hayas terminado de ayudarlos, enviaré un mensaje a Narfi para informarle que nos has ayudado con éxito a evitar la invasión de Lothlórien.\
\
'Aunque no siento mucho aprecio por los Elfos, de nada nos servirá que caiga su mayor fortaleza.'","Ayuda a Sigir a recuperar las herramientas robadas","'Habla con Raf y Sigir. Ellos te dirán qué hay que hacer para garantizar el control de las forjas mientras expulsan a los orcos de ese lugar.'"},
[3427]={"Defeat cave-claws and deep-claws in the Pit of Stonejaws (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Tunnels in the north-east side of the Pit of Stonejaws contain many cave-claws and deep-claws.","Claws of Obstruction","Gráfar Splitstone needs your help clearing out a den of beasts.","'Oh, I could use your help, ${PLAYER}. We Gem-cutters have come to assess the ore and minerals in the Pit of Stonejaws, but this place is crawling with beasts and things look to be difficult. We found some tunnels on the north-eastern side of the Pit of Stonejaws that look rich with veins and precious gems, but they are thick with cave-claws and their deep-claw cousins. Do you think you might spare the time to clear them out for us?'","Gráfar Splitstone waits to hear about your efforts against the cave-claws.","'Did you clear out those beasts? Good! I have never liked cave-claws, you know. And they seem to be everywhere!\
\
'Now I, Gráfar Splitstone, can get to work doing what I do best!'","Habla con Gráfar Partipiedra"},
[3428]={"Garras de las profundidades","Derrota Rascabismos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Los Rascabismos pueden encontrarse en la Gran Excavación, especialmente en el camino oriental desde el Mirador de la Gran Excavación.\
\
Deberías derrotar a muchos Rascabismos en la Gran Excavación, pero sería prudente centrar tu atención en la ruta oriental hacia Zelem-melek.","Regresa con Wafri en el Mirador de la Gran Excavación","'Por favor, elimina algunos de esos Rascabismos antes de que hagan colapsar toda Moria. Me temo que serán un problema constante en tus viajes por aquí.'","Los Rascabismos vagan por la Gran Excavación, especialmente cerca del Mirador de la Gran Excavación. Estos monstruosos excavadores hacen que las profundidades sean inestables.","'Lo primero es lo primero: he notado que hay varios Rascabismos rondando peligrosamente cerca del Mirador de la Gran Excavación, ¿no te has dado cuenta? Creo que hay un gran nido cerca.\
\
'No son bestias especialmente agresivas, pero no podemos tolerar sus túneles. Es peligroso, y creo que son la causa de tantas trampas, derrumbes y sacudidas en general en Moria.\
\
'Reduzcamos un poco su número. ¿Qué dices?'","Wafri se encuentra en el campamento del Mirador de la Gran Excavación en la Gran Excavación.\
\
Deberías hablar con Wafri y decirle que has derrotado a muchos Rascabismos en los alrededores.","'Hola de nuevo, ${PLAYER}. ¡Me alegra ver que esos Rascabismos no han hecho tiras tu piel! Desde luego, has prestado un gran servicio a los enanos de esta expedición.'","Has derrotado a un Rascabismos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[3429]={"Los devastadores con pico de cuchilla se pueden encontrar por todo el Ram Dúath.\
\
Reko te ha pedido que le traigas los picos de los devastadores con pico de cuchilla que desea.","Reko, el cazador de los Hijos de la Tierra, desea los picos de los devastadores con pico de cuchilla, aunque no dirá para qué.","Garras de la Tierra","'Tú allí... ¿ayudas a Reko?\
\
'Garras de los devastadores. No, ¿cómo se dice? ¿Picos? ¿Como los pájaros? Sí, picos de los devastadores.\
\
'Ve a conseguir picos de los devastadores. Te daré piezas brillantes de metal tomadas de los orcos. Muchos devastadores con pico de cuchilla no están lejos.'","'¿No hay picos? No hay piezas brillantes.'","Lleva los picos de los devastadores con pico de cuchilla a Reko, que te espera en Lehmä-koti.","Recupera los picos de los devastadores con pico de cuchilla (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Me has traído muchos picos. Eso es bueno. Aquí tienes las piezas brillantes.'","Picos de devastadores con pico de cuchilla recuperados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[3433]={"'You see all these dead Orcs?'\
\
You nod.\
\
'They aren't any of mine, Silent One. Shagrat had command before me, and he let his garrison get torn apart by a single Elf-warrior! Of course, he made it out fine. Fine enough, indeed, to bring some trinkets to Lugbúrz, but that's no way for an Uruk to lead!\
\
'We've spent days burning the bodies and there's still more left. A right mess old Shagrat left us!\
\
'If you see a dead Orc, burn it! This place already reeks of tarks and Elves... I won't have stink of dead Orcs, too!'","You have burned many of the dead Orcs from Shagrat's garrison. Perhaps it is best if Captain Róglarg continues to believe that an Elf-warrior slew Shagrat's Orcs, rather than a quarrel over Frodo's mithril-coat.","Burn slain Orcs from Shagrat's garrison in Cirith Ungol (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Slain Orcs from Shagrat's garrison can be found throughout Cirith Ungol.\
\
Disappointed in the actions of his predecessor, Captain Róglarg has asked you to burn any slain Orcs you discover in Cirith Ungol.","You have burned many of the dead Orcs from Shagrat's garrison.","Burned slain Orcs from Shagrat's garrison in Cirith Ungol (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Captain Róglarg is irritated that the dead Orcs of Captain Shagrat's garrison still litter Cirith Ungol.","Completado","Cleaning Up Shagrat's Garrison"},
[3434]={"Destroyed intact stone trolls (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Master smith, Grámi Hornhelm, wants Máttugard cleaned up and looking more a city and less a tomb.","Cleaning Up the Halls","Destroy intact stone trolls (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Grámi Hornhelm can be found at Maergrind in Máttugard.\
\
You should talk to Grámi Hornhelm.","Stone trolls can be found west of Maergrind.\
\
You should destroy any of the stone trolls that you find.","Destroy broken stone trolls (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Ah, Gundabad looks more like a city now! Still there is dust to clear away and much more work to be done.'","Talk to Grámi Hornhelm","'Since you are traversing Máttugard, might you have some time to clean up the place? It has been a long while since dwarves last occupied these halls. Máttugard is in a decent enough shape due in part to the ingenuity of the dwarves' mirror traps. A cave-troll caught in the trap's light will immediately turn to stone! No dwarf-city should have troll statues scattered about. They should be removed! As you know, trolls are not very bright, thus many have been caught in the mirror traps over the years.'","Destroyed broken stone trolls (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[3435]={"Find the hidden store-room","You have collected a good amount of spoils. Perhaps this is enough for Mânobaz.\
\
Mânobaz can be found next to the Black Anchor.","Cleaning the Gut","Mânobaz has asked you to steal a portion of spoils that is rightfully his from the The Eastern Stores.\
\
The Eastern Stores can be found on the east side of the Lower Ward in the Cistern.","Plunder collected (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Well, would you look at that. You did it! You've gone and collected quite a haul.\
\
'I have to admit, I did not think you'd do it, but you are a fair and honest individual now aren't you? And us fair and honest individuals must uphold the strictest code of fairness!\
\
'You've got yourself a friend in Umbar!'","Collect Mânobaz's plunder (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Talk to Mânobaz","Mânobaz is feeling ostracized by his cohorts even after helping to plunder and raid.","'Can you believe this nonsense?\
\
'I go and help these so called friends sack and plunder, and they go and take all the spoils for themselves! I was instrumental in securing that loot, and I deserve a portion of it!\
\
'What do you say? Would you help me take back my fair share? I'm not saying to rob them clean, I am an honest and fair individual myself. I just have to look after my enterprises is all.\
\
'Now, there's a secret store-room where all the ne'er-do-wells keep their prized possessions. It's in the Waterways Market just outside of the Gut. It is sure to be guarded. No need to be specific, just grab whatever you can and bring it back to me.'","You have found the Eastern Stores. The plunder should be stored within."},
[3437]={"Los trolls de las nieves están entre muchas criaturas malignas que han tomado refugio en las ruinas de la antigua ciudad enana llamada Sarnúr por los Elfos.","'Saludos, valiente ${PLAYER}. Es bueno verte.\
\
'En lo profundo de Sarnúr, una gran fuerza de trolls se ha estado reuniendo desde hace un tiempo. A medida que mi gente ha explorado más hacia las profundidades, estas criaturas se han vuelto más temibles. ¿Reunirías un grupo de amigos y acabarías con estos trolls?\
\
'Viaja a Sarnúr, al sur de la Mansión de Thorin, más allá de las ruinas de Orodost, que se encuentran en las montañas occidentales de Ered Luin.'","Habla con Snár en la Mansión de Thorin","Derrota a trolls de las nieves lanzadores (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'¡No puedo tolerar a los trolls! ¡Expúlsalos de Sarnúr, si eres capaz!'","Trolls de las nieves brutos derrotados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Derrota a trolls de las nieves brutos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Saludos, ${PLAYER}. Deseo agradecerte por entrar a las cavernas y acabar con esas criaturas viles.\
\
'Informes de la zona cuentan que el problema es mucho peor de lo que sabíamos. ¡Tus logros serán difundidos entre los Enanos de Ered Luin!\
\
'Por favor ven a verme si decides viajar de nuevo a Sarnúr, pues puede que tenga más tareas para ti.'","Los trolls de las nieves pueden encontrarse en lo profundo de Sarnúr, al sur de la Mansión de Thorin, accediendo a través de las ruinas de Orodost.\
\
Snár te ha pedido que entres en las antiguas ruinas de Sarnúr y derrotes a varios de los trolls de las nieves reunidos allí.","Limpia las Ruinas de Sarnúr","Snár está en la Mansión de Thorin, al norte de Sarnúr, justo fuera del Cuartel de la Piedra Azul.\
\
Debes regresar con Snár con noticias de tu victoria contra los trolls de las nieves.","Trolls de las nieves lanzadores derrotados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[3438]={"Talk to Tucharn","Glathril can be found in Erynos in eastern Lebennin.\
\
You have examined the fallen Corsairs and should now return to Glathril.","'The tale you have told me is a strange one, ${PLAYER}...\
\
'I, too, am not sure what to make of it. However, it is heartening to know that some of our folk remain safe from the Enemy.\
\
'Thank you for travelling so far on my behalf - these tidings have eased some of my worries.'","'I awoke to the sound of water rushing away, but by the time I could clothe myself, all I found was the company of men on the road.\
\
'I do not know what to make of it, traveller. We are not like the folk of Malbarth in our devotion to old fables, but... perhaps we should be.\
\
'I looked them all over, but I could not understand what I found. I would urge you to search them yourself before you return whence you came.'","This Corsair's clothing is drenched and his boots overflow with water","This Corsair lies facedown in a puddle","Talk to Glathril","Search fallen Corsairs in Erynos (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","'All of them drowned... but we are so far from the water's edge, and so much higher! This makes little sense, ${PLAYER}.\
\
'As for Tucharn, he moved here from Malbarth when he married, but I think he has always carried his beliefs with him. I do not know if this truly could mean that the Sisters have returned to aid us... but I struggle to find any other meaning from this.\
\
'Thank you for coming to our aid, but we are safe... and I wonder what this could mean for my people. I am sure we shall all soon speak of what has happened here today.'","Corsairs can be found along the road outside Erynos.\
\
Tucharn has asked you to look over the fallen Corsairs on the road out of Erynos.","Cleansed of Fear","In the wake of a mysteriously stifled Corsair attack, the people of Erynos have been granted an unexpected peace.","Tucharn can be found in Erynos in eastern Lebennin.\
\
Glathril is unclear how the Corsairs met with such a fate and asks you to speak to Tucharn.","This Corsair's clothing is damp to the touch","This Corsair appears to have drowned, despite being just outside Erynos","'When I awoke this morn, I found these men lying in the road. I dared not get too close to them for I have known the Corsairs to be deceitful folk... but strange things are afoot, traveller.\
\
'They have not moved for hours, so I think them dead, but you must forgive my caution. They look as if a great wave had crushed them where they stood, but no one seems to know what actually happened.\
\
'Tucharn is often one of our earliest risers in the morning, so perhaps he saw something while we all slept.'","Nimithil can be found in Ost Anglebed in north-central Lebennin.\
\
You have found the people of Erynos safe from harm, and should now tell Nimithil of what happened.","Talk to Nimithil in Ost Anglebed"},
[3439]={"Recoge hierbas húmedas y fragantes (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Calengil está en Duillond, al norte de Celondim.\
\
Debes devolver las hierbas que recogiste a Calengil.","'La poción aún se está preparando, pero pronto necesitaré infusionarla con las hierbas que te pedí.'","Las hierbas se pueden encontrar a lo largo de la ribera del río debajo de Duillond. \
\
Calengil te ha pedido que recuperes las hierbas que necesita para completar la poción purificadora.","'Encontrarás que la hierba crece en las orillas del río bajo Duillond, corriendo de norte a sur.'","Calengil te ha pedido que recojas algunas hierbas para él como parte de una poción que está creando para limpiar una oscura corrupción de las ruinas cerca de Duillond.","Hierbas húmedas y fragantes recogidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Devuelve las hierbas que recogiste a Calengil","Poción purificadora","'¿Has decidido ayudarme? Excelente. Conozco una poción que debería limpiar la corrupción de las ruinas de Dol Ringwest. Tengo la mayoría de los ingredientes que necesito, pero me falta una hierba: una hierba fragante que crece en las orillas del río, que corre de norte a sur bajo Duillond.\
\
Es sencillo recogerla, y lo haría yo mismo, pero la infusión está en una etapa delicada y debo vigilarla de cerca. ¿Podrías recoger las hierbas que necesito, ${PLAYER}?'","'¡Ah! Justo a tiempo. El último paso del proceso es añadir las hierbas que has recogido para mí. Después solo necesita reposar unos minutos y la poción estará lista.'"},
[3443]={"'Excellently done! A grisly task, but necessary.'","Burned piles of Orc-filth  (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Cleansing the Dvergvát","The rivers of Elderslade are polluted, fouling the sparkling waters of the Dvergvát.","'Water is essential, and whoever controls the waterways will have an advantage in this war. Our forces also need clean water to drink, but the rivers have been fouled by filth that the Orcs have strewn about. Their waters flow into the Dvergvát, whose sapphire waters are famed among the dwarves.\
\
'Find the piles the Orcs have left behind and burn them. The Dvergvát will return to its former glory and our troops may partake of its waters without harm.'","Piles of Orc-filth can be found along river-beds in Elderslade.\
\
Mother Amma has tasked you with cleansing the rivers that flow into the Dvergvát.","Talk to Mother Amma","Mother Amma is in Annâk-khurfu, in eastern Elderslade.\
\
You should talk to Mother Amma.","'We must cleanse the rivers if we are to have the water we need.'","Burn piles of Orc-filth (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[3444]={"'This is a great success. You are most welcome here at Glân Vraig, and I hope that you are able to assist the other Free Peoples throughout the Ettenmoors.\
\
'Remember, this war will not be decided easily. We are too few in number to score a decisive blow to the encampment at Gramsfoot. Ofttimes we will lose our holdings, but while we retain them there is much to do.\
\
'Be well, friend.'","'${PLAYER}, you are known to many of the Elves of Rivendell... nay, do not be surprised. I have a delicate matter that needs attention, and I believe you may be the ${RACE} for the matter.\
\
'The waterfall above Tol Ascarnen has seen Angmar's forces visiting near its banks. Scouts report that they dump barrels of viscous material into the Hoarwell and further investigation has yielded evidence that the river is being poisoned. I have created a draught that will counteract this poison, but it must be delivered to the Hoarwell quickly. \
\
'I ask that you take this draught and make your way to the waterfall overlooking Tol Ascarnen and deposit it into the river to cleanse the poison. Do this, and I shall see that you are rewarded.'","Captain-General Tordúr explained that scouts near Tol Ascarnen have seen a number of Angmar's servants dumping the contents of barrels into the river. Drawing water from the river shows that the river is slowly being poisoned. If this is allowed to continue, then the hobbits at Hoarhallow will certainly perish.","Cleanse the Hoarwell River of the poison introduced by Angmar","The poison of the Angmarim was introduced here","Poison cleansed","'Is it yet done, ${PLAYER}? We must be swift, else the Little Folk at Hoarhallow will suffer a terrible fate at the hands of Angmar.'","The poison was introduced to the Hoarwell at the waterfall overlooking Tol Ascarnen, in the central area of the Ettenmoors, north-west of Glán Vraig.\
\
Captain-General Tordúr asked you to make your way to the top of the waterfall overlooking Tol Ascarnen to assist in cleansing the poison that the goblins of Angmar introduced into the Hoarwell River.","The cleansing agent has been introduced to the Hoarwell","Captain-General Tordúr is at Glân Vraig.\
\
You should return to Captain-General Tordúr with news of your success.","Cleansing the Hoarwell"},
[3445]={"Habla con Radagast","Defeat corrupted roots (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Cleansing the Mirkwood","You should defeat corrupted roots and give water to trees in need throughout Eryn Lasgalen.","Collect phials (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Ah, there is more to be done! The Elves of Felegoth have prepared more healing draughts for the ailing roots of Eryn Lasgalen, and I would ask that you nourish those in need. For those too far gone to decay and corruption, do what you must. Nature heals most of its ills, but we must help where we can.\
\
'Take some phials with you and venture into the forest. Eryn Lasgalen shall flourish once more!'","You should return to Radagast, who can be found at the tree nursery just outside of Felegoth.","Defeated corrupted roots (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Collected phials (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Radagast has grown concerned by the ailing roots of Eryn Lasgalen and hopes to heal the forest of decay and corruption.","'Ah, I feel the life returning to this land. That is good. Good indeed!\
\
'I will call on you again soon!'","Sprinkle trees in need with the healing draught (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","You should collect phials of the Elves' healing draught from within Felegoth."},
[3446]={"Derrota a los Ucornos en Hordírid (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Purificando la madera podrida","Tu misión es viajar a Hordírid al noroeste para detener a los peligrosos Ucornos y limpiar los árboles corrompidos en la zona.","Purifica los árboles corrompidos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Me entristece que tengamos que atacar el bosque de esta manera, pero es necesario para ralentizar la infección. Has hecho un buen trabajo. Volvamos a Sul Madásh.'","¡Un Ucorno de aspecto peligroso se ha despertado!","Árboles corrompidos purificados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Ucornos eliminados en Hordírid (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Derrota al Ucorno despiadado de Adagím"},
[3447]={"'¿Has estado en Dol Ringwest? Está al oeste de aquí.'","Encuentra la segunda torre de Dol Ringwest","'Dol Ringwest se encuentra al oeste. Lleva el brebaje a las torres.'","Usa el brebaje cerca de la primera torre","Usa el brebaje cerca de la segunda torre","Purificando las ruinas","Encuentra la primera torre de Dol Ringwest","Calengil ha preparado su brebaje y te ha ofrecido el honor de limpiar Dol Ringwest. El brebaje, con el tiempo, fomentará el crecimiento de grandes vides que envolverán las ruinas, derribándolas y devolviéndolas a la naturaleza prístina.","'Gracias, ${PLAYER}. Me duele saber que nunca más caminaré entre las torres, que recuerdo de mi juventud, pero es mejor esto que dejar la Tierra Media sabiendo que son hogar de criaturas de oscuridad.'","Regresa a Calengil en Duillond, al este de Dol Ringwest","'El brebaje está listo; solo queda rociarlo sobre el suelo dentro de las ruinas de Dol Ringwest. Fomentará y acelerará el crecimiento de las vides naturales que suelen encontrarse en estos lugares, tanto que para el final de la próxima primavera las ruinas estarán cubiertas por una gran masa de ellas. En poco tiempo, reducirán las ruinas a escombros, devolviéndolas a la naturaleza prístina una vez más.\
\
Te ofrezco el honor de esta tarea, pues ahora veo que no puedo destruir el lugar que tanto amé, incluso en su estado ruinoso. Vierte el brebaje en el suelo bajo las dos torres que permanecen en pie entre las ruinas.\
\
El tiempo y las fuerzas de la naturaleza harán el resto sin nuestra ayuda.'","Usa el brebaje purificador aquí","Brebaje usado","Dol Ringwest está al oeste de Duillond.\
\
Calengil te pidió que vertieras el brebaje purificador en el suelo, en la base de las dos torres que permanecen en pie en las ruinas de Dol Ringwest.","Calengil está en Duillond, al este de Dol Ringwest.\
\
Debes regresar con Calengil e informarle que tu tarea en las ruinas de Dol Ringwest está completa."},
[3449]={"El derrumbe que Sót te ha pedido despejar se encuentra en la parte oriental de la Gran Excavación, al sur de la puerta que conduce a la Extensión Solitaria.\
\
Sót, el bibliotecario de la expedición del Mirador de la Gran Excavación, te ha pedido que le ayudes despejando de escombros el camino que lleva a la Extensión Solitaria.","Habla con Sót en el campamento del Mirador de la Gran Excavación","Sót se encuentra en el campamento del Mirador de la Gran Excavación, al suroeste de la Extensión Solitaria.\
\
Los escombros del derrumbe han sido despejados. Deberías regresar con Sót e informarle.","Escombros despejados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Despeja los escombros (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Perdona que te lo pida, ${PLAYER}, pero ¿podrías echarme una mano? Me uní a esta expedición como bibliotecario, con la esperanza de descubrir el saber perdido y los misterios de Khazad-dûm, pero hay tanto que hacer aquí que me han asignado una lista de duras tareas para las que temo no estar capacitado.\
\
'Parece que un reciente derrumbe ha cubierto de escombros el camino entre aquí y la Sala Vigesimoprimera, lo que dificulta el tránsito, y necesitamos despejar ese tramo del pasaje si queremos seguir abasteciendo la Sala Vigesimoprimera.\
\
'El derrumbe tuvo lugar en la zona más oriental de la Gran Excavación, a lo largo del camino justo al sur de la puerta que conduce a la Extensión Solitaria.'","'Sigue trabajando. Debemos despejar suficientes escombros como para poder trasladar suministros con seguridad a nuestros campamentos más profundos.'","Despejar los túneles","Los caminos que parten del Mirador de la Gran Excavación están obstruidos por escombros y derrumbes, lo que dificulta el tránsito.","'¡Excelente! Ahora que el camino vuelve a estar despejado, será mucho más fácil llevar suministros a la Sala Vigesimoprimera.'"},
[3450]={"'Antes de que te vayas, ${PLAYER}, quisiera pedirte otra pequeña tarea, pendiente de la última gente que se detuvo a ayudarnos aquí.\
\
'Tenemos algunos odres ya limpios y listos para agua. Te pido que vayas por el Gran Camino del Este hasta el Último Puente y llenes este odre con agua del Mitheithel, el Fontegrís.\
\
'El puente ha resistido muchas eras, y hemos comprobado que el agua tomada del extremo norte del puente es la mejor. Extrae el agua y luego vuelve conmigo.'","'Ahora tenemos agua para llenar nuestros barriles. Estoy agradecido por todo lo que has hecho por mi gente. Aquí tienes, ${PLAYER}, toma esto y recibe la gratitud de todos los Eglain de Ost Guruth.'","'Asegúrate de volver conmigo una vez que hayas recogido el agua del Mitheithel.'","Agua clara","Lleva el odre de agua a Northrim","Odre de agua lleno","Llena el odre de agua","'Tienes mi agradecimiento y el de mi gente por todo lo que has hecho, ${PLAYER}.'","El Último Puente está en el extremo oriental del Gran Camino del Este.\
\
Northrim te dio un odre vacío y curado y te pidió que recogieras agua del Fontegrís en el lado norte del Último Puente.","Dentro de las ruinas de Dol Vaeg, Northrim reúne los últimos objetos necesarios para la defensa de Stanric. Pronto los Eglain esperan estar preparados para lo peor: una batalla prolongada contra la oscuridad que se cierne.","Llena el odre de agua en El Último Puente","'Llena el odre en la orilla del agua, en el lado norte del Último Puente, y luego regresa aquí.'","Northrim espera tu regreso con agua limpia en Dol Vaeg, al oeste del Último Puente.\
\
Fuiste hasta la orilla del Fontegrís y recogiste agua de sus riberas. Debes volver de inmediato con Northrim.","El agua aquí parece fresca y limpia"},
[3451]={"Clear a Path","Talk to Dorgam within the Orc encampment","Inform Dorgam that you have defeated some of the forces surrounding his position. He is east of Barad Angarth.","The Orcs that threaten the Rangers can be found to the east of Barad Angarth.\
\
Deplete the Orc forces as you make your way further into the encampment.","'Thank you for the help, ${PLAYER}.\
\
'Now that you have thinned the numbers of some of the forces surrounding us, we should find it easier to seek out information concerning our entrenched foe.'","Defeat Orcs to the east of Barad Angarth (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Orcs have fortified the outer ring of Minas Morgul, to the east. Thin the ranks of the Orcs in this area, so the Rangers can proceed further into the Dead City.","'Thank you for your offer of aid in this dark time; we have greater need of it than ever! Two Orc armies have begun to fortify their positions within the outer tier of Minas Morgul, putting a stop to our forward advance.\
\
'I sent two Rangers, Dorgam and Dolenthol, westward into the city. They will attempt to gain more information about the area, but could still use your assistance to defeat any of the Orcs you might encounter.\
\
'Please reduce their numbers as we seek to learn more about the dangers that await us within the city.'","Has derrotado orcos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[3452]={"Despeja los Caminos","'Todavía hay osos salvajes y feroces que asolan los caminos. Continúa cazando a las bestias y vuelve a mí cuando hayas logrado reducir su número.'","Osos feroces se han vuelto numerosos y audaces al norte de Noglond, a lo largo del camino que atraviesa el Valle de Thráin, haciendo que viajar por el valle sea inseguro.","La Hondonada del Cazador se encuentra al norte de Noglond.\
\
Ketill te ha pedido que caces osos en la Hondonada del Cazador y reduzcas su número.","'Nadie se ha esforzado en mantener los caminos despejados durante mucho tiempo. Bueno, ¡eso va a cambiar!'","'Gracias por tu ayuda con los osos. Gracias a ti, el camino volverá a ser seguro.'","Derrota osos en el Valle de Thráin (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Ketill está en Noglond, al sur de la Mansión de Thorin.\
\
Debes regresar con Ketill e informarle del resultado de tu patrulla.","'Hubo un tiempo en que nuestros cazadores mantenían bajo control el número de osos, pero, por desgracia, las bestias se han multiplicado en los últimos años. Es vergonzoso, en verdad, que hayamos permitido que lo salvaje invada nuestros caminos. Mientras los enanos habiten aquí, los senderos deberían ser seguros.\
\
'Si quieres ayudar, patrulla hacia el norte desde Noglond hasta la Hondonada del Cazador y elimina cualquier bestia que encuentres.\
\
'Con tu ayuda, volveremos a hacer seguro el camino.'","Osos derrotados en el Valle de Thráin (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Los caminos deberían ser seguros, al menos por un tiempo, gracias a ti, ${PLAYER}.'"},
[3453]={"Despeja el Camino","'¿No tuviste suerte con los trasgos? Bueno, sigue intentándolo. Mi cuadrilla podrá despejar la obstrucción tan pronto como termines tu parte. El campamento trasgo está al oeste de aquí.'","El canal cerca de Gondamon está al oeste, más allá de las colinas.\
\
Otkell, el Maestro Constructor de Gondamon, te informó que los trasgos son responsables de la falta de agua fresca. Te pidió que vayas al área al oeste del canal y elimines la amenaza trasga.","'Los trasgos en estas colinas no dejan de causarnos problemas. Han bloqueado el río con escombros y han reducido el flujo a un hilo, y el poco agua que queda está contaminada por su presencia.\
\
'Puedo enviar una cuadrilla para retirar los escombros, pero necesito a alguien con valor y buen brazo para la espada que se encargue de algunos de esos trasgos. No puedo arriesgar a perder trabajadores, especialmente con los Duramano causando problemas.\
\
'Puedes encontrar el canal al oeste de aquí, justo más allá de las colinas. Los trasgos tienen un campamento al oeste de su presa improvisada.'","Otkell está en Gondamon, al este del canal, más allá de las colinas.\
\
Deberías regresar con Otkell y contarle sobre los trasgos que derrotaste.","'¿Es seguro para mis cuadrillas? Excelente. No enviaría a mis muchachos con todos esos trasgos rondando. Necesitamos a todos los guardias aquí para protegernos de los malditos Duramano, por si atacan.'","El suministro de agua que llega a Gondamon sigue interrumpido, a pesar de tus esfuerzos por despejar el canal."},
[3454]={"'The Orcs of Ak-ghru may be preparing to wage war on the Dunlendings -- though I doubt it, for they seem not to care about the Dunlendings moving through the Gravenwood -- but they might just as well be preparing to pour out of the Misty Mountains against Rohan.\
\
'I would have you clear-cut these Orcs just as they lay waste to the forest around them... perhaps then they will understand that Rohan is still strong.'","Elfrith is hiding beyond the bounds of Ak-ghru.\
\
You should return to Elfrith with news of your success.","'Well done, ${PLAYER}... the Orcs of Ak-ghru will know now that the Rohirrim are not to be trifled with.'","Orcs serving the White Hand are clear-cutting the forest and shipping the wood off to an unknown location.","Defeated Orcs at Ak-ghru (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Defeat Orcs at Ak-ghru (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Clear-cutting Orcs","Talk to Elfrith","Orcs can be found at Ak-ghru.\
\
Elfrith has asked you to defeat many of the clear-cutting Orcs."},
[3455]={"Clearing Cirith Ungol","Broodling eggs and encroaching webs can be found in Cirith Ungol's courtyard and the tower interior.\
\
You should destroy broodling eggs and encroaching webs.","Burned encroaching webs (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Burn encroaching webs (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","A note hangs on the board, signed by Atli Spider-bane:\
\
'We cannot allow Cirith Ungol to become infested with spiders now that it is no longer infested with Orcs! I need someone to get in there and clear some of the eggs and webs, quickly!'","Destroy broodling eggs (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Destroyed broodling eggs (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Atli Spider-bane has requested an adventurer to enter Cirith Ungol and clear out some of the spider eggs and webs."},
[3457]={"'Well met, friend. The enemy is thick around the ruins of Zarkul-sulûn. Anything you can do to thin their ranks will greatly help the cause.'","Zarkul-sulûn is crawling with enemies who need to be removed.","Clearing Enemies in Zarkul-sulûn","Zarkul-sulûn can be found in southern Elderslade.\
\
You should defeat enemies within the ruins of Zarkul-sulûn.","Gunvald is in Annâk-khurfu in Elderslade.\
\
Return to Gunvald.","Flechas negras de Gundabad derrotados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Laugi told me he asked you to thin the ranks of the enemies in Zarkul-sulûn. Well done, friend. You have done for us a great service this day.'","Defeated Gundabad warriors (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Defeat Gundabad warriors (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Return to Gunvald","Derrota a los flechas negras de Gundabad (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[3458]={"Derrota orcos en Mudmul-charâf (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Muchos orcos acechan en Mudmul-charâf, sin otro propósito que poner en peligro a los Pueblos Libres que recorren Khazad-dûm.","Limpiando Mudmul-charâf","Puedes encontrar orcos en Mudmul-charâf, en los pasajes del noroeste de Zelem-melek.\
\
Deberías derrotar a los orcos en Mudmul-charâf.","Has derrotado a varios orcos en su campamento en Mudmul-charâf, haciendo que las salas de Zelem-melek sean más seguras para los viajeros que van y vienen de la Sala Vigesimoprimera.","Completado","Orco derrotado (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[3460]={"Complete: Victims of the Ambushers","Complete: Trouble Comes Down the Mountain","Lorndúr can be found in Loeglond.\
\
You should talk to Lorndúr.","Lorndúr can be found in Loeglond.\
\
You should complete quests for Lorndúr.","Talk to Lorndúr","Lorndúr has told you of several problems plaguing trade on the Forest River. Help the raft-elves so they can return to trade upon the water!","Clearing the Forest River","'Thank you for all you have done for us, ${PLAYER}. There is one more danger that I am aware of: Esgaroth.'","Complete: Thievery on the River","'We should begin with troubles along the Forest River. Shipments are sent downstream from Felegoth, and then picked up here in Loeglond before being sent off to the Long Lake. Not long ago, shipments began going missing before even reaching us. I suspect Orcs are involved. Please do what you can to make the Forest River safer for us.'"},
[3462]={"Limpia los excrementos de cabra del camino (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Nuestros viejos amigos se han marchado y los echaremos de menos, pero estoy preocupado por ellos. Se fueron con una cabra enferma, que apenas podía tirar de su carro de provisiones. Creo que la cabra ha dejado sus porquerías en el camino.\
\
'¿Podrías seguir el camino hacia el suelo de la caverna del Cuerno Rojo y asegurarte de que los enanos llegaron bien? Por favor, toma esta pala y ayuda a limpiar los desechos que dejaron en el sendero.'","'¡Algunos de nuestros mejores enanos se han ido! La Guardia Orca solía ser un lugar más acogedor, pero ya han quedado atrás los días en que nuestros viejos amigos consideraban este sitio su hogar. Fue un día triste cuando partieron en busca de riquezas y fama hacia las profundidades de las Vetas del Cuerno Rojo.\
\
'Deberías lamentarlo con mis compañeros enanos aquí presentes, que quizás tengan más que decir al respecto. Yo tengo que seguir con mi cerveza...'","Parece que la cabra ha dejado un montón de... desechos en un rincón del campamento. Este sería un buen lugar para dejar la... suciedad del camino.","Habla con Ingifast","'Es cierto, esto parece vacío sin ellos. Nuestros amigos partieron en busca de riquezas incalculables, pero dudo que quede mucho allí abajo con esos orcos correteando por todas partes, por no hablar de los gredbyg...\
\
'Ingifast me insinuó, antes de partir, que creía que la compañía se separaría en algún punto del camino. Ingifast quería que se mantuvieran juntos, con todos los peligros a los que podrían enfrentarse allí. Algunos estaban decididos a dirigirse a la caverna del sur, mientras que Ingifast y Róarr estaban interesados en el mineral abundante que se encontraba alrededor de las antiguas vías de la mina.'","Los enanos de la Guardia Orca son cada vez menos. Los que llevaban más tiempo allí se han marchado en una expedición en busca de riquezas y aventuras en las Vetas del Cuerno Rojo.","Añadiste a la pila lo que habías recogido...","'Aparte de que nuestra cabra no se encuentra bien, ¡nos hemos topado con un montón de orcos que nos impiden llegar al mineral que vinimos a buscar!\
\
'No pasó ni una noche antes de que la compañía que vigilaba a los orcos se separara. Kúli se llevó a Auti con él para buscar tesoros y mineral en la caverna del sur, y Knakk se fue con Kafli y se dirigió al este, ¡atravesando el territorio de los orcos! Me preocupan esos dos... Espero que hayan llegado bien a dondequiera que se dirigieran.'","Limpiando el camino","'Róarr no paraba de hablar de las aventuras que él y sus compañeros enanos tendrían en el Cuerno Rojo. Es un minero de vocación y ya lleva demasiado tiempo aquí en la Guardia Orca. Le partía el corazón pensar en el mineral que sabía que había ahí fuera.\
\
'Si ves a mi querido viejo amigo, por favor, salúdalo de mi parte.'","Habla con Ossur en la Guardia Orca","Una compañía de enanos de la Guardia Orca partió en busca de riquezas y aventuras que les esperaban en las Vetas del Cuerno Rojo. La mayoría de ellos son mineros de vocación, y estaban perdiendo el ánimo por llevar demasiado tiempo encerrados en la Guardia.","Deja los 'desechos' en el montón que hay cerca de la cabra","Regresa con Ingifast","Desechos que dejó una cabra al pasar por allí recogidos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Los enanos del campamento estarán más dispuestos a hablar contigo ahora que te has librado del olor. Pero las primeras impresiones nunca se olvidan, y puede que te recuerden por eso.","Hay que limpiar el camino que va desde la Guardia Orca hasta las Vetas del Cuerno Rojo, ya que la compañía de enanos dejó mucha suciedad a su paso.","Algunos miembros de la compañía de enanos han acampado al pie de las escaleras que llevan al Cuerno Rojo. Han preferido no abandonar a su cabra ni su carro.","Habla con Thithrand en la Guardia Orca","Habla con Isólf en la Guardia Orca","'¡Vaya, qué mal hueles!\
\
'Oh, ¿has limpiado el camino detrás de nosotros? La cabra que tiraba de nuestra carreta desde la Guardia Orca no parecía sentirse bien. Gracias por limpiar los desechos, pero por favor llévalos rápidamente al montón que hay cerca de la cabra. ¡Pareces un poco ${PLAYERNAME:mareado[m]|mareada[f]} por el olor, y puede que yo también me maree pronto!'"},
[3463]={"You have destroyed many Avanc-jaw traps and cleared the road for passing Rohirrim.","Limpiando el camino","Destroyed Avanc-jaw traps (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Along the road and throughout the surrounding forest west of Middlemead, you have discovered crude traps of Dunlending make. These traps would hamstring even the mightiest of steeds, and could be deadly to any passing warrior of the Rohirrim.\
\
If you were to destroy these traps, the people of Middlemead would be protected from such a fate, and the road to the Stonedeans would once again be safe to travel.","The road is still strewn with traps.","Cruel traps of Dunlending make litter the road west of Middlemead in hopes of crippling the Rohirrim and their steeds alike.","Completado","You have cleared the road of the Dunlendings' cruel traps and opened the way anew between Kingstead and the Stonedeans. The people of Middlemead are thankful for your aid.","Avanc-jaw traps can be found along the road west out of Middlemead in Kingstead.\
\
You have discovered cruel Dunlending traps and should destroy them to protect the warriors and steeds of Middlemead.","Destroy Avanc-jaw traps (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[3464]={"Derrota a los bandidos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Derrota a Ulâmul la Garra","Ulâmul la Garra derrotado","Descubrir emplazamientos del ataque (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Despejando la Ruta del Sur","'Has hecho un gran trabajo, ${PLAYER}, al hacer que estas rutas sean seguras nuevamente al poner fin a los terrores que Ulâmul la Garra y sus compañeros han causado. Regresemos a Iridír.'","Bandidos derrotados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","¡Ulâmul la Garra ha llegado! ¡Derrótalo!","Tu misión es investigar la zona donde ha habido muchos informes de bandidos y ponerles fin, así como a su líder, Ulâmul la Garra.","¡Ulâmul la Garra ha llegado!","Emplazamiento del ataque descubierto"},
[3465]={"'My bretheren have been quietly gathering and sending supplies north to a hidden refuge we have settled east of the ruins of Fornost in the North Downs. Unfortunately, the scouts and small convoys we have been using to transport these supplies have suffered frequent ambushes by the Tarkrîp Orcs who infest the hills of Nan Wathren, north and east of Trestlebridge.\
\
'I need to find brave warriors who can travel there and put an end to these Tarkrîp-raiders and clear the way for our supplies.'","Clearing the Way","Nidgyl is at Bree-town in Bree-land, far to the south of the North Downs.\
\
You should return to Nidgyl and tell him of your assault against the Tarkrîp Orcs.","Tarkrîp Orcs can be found in Nan Wathren, north-east of Trestlebridge in the North Downs, far to the north of Bree.\
\
Nidgyl has asked you to defeat the Tarkrîp Orcs in Nan Wathren.","Nidgyl is concerned with the Tarkrîp-raiders who have been ambushing the Rangers and their convoys of late in Nan Wathren.","Defeated Tarkrîp Orcs in Nan Wathren (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Defeat Tarkrîp Orcs in Nan Wathren (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Talk to Nidgyl","'I thank you for your aid in driving back the Tarkrîp Orcs, ${PLAYER}. While they remain a threat to Trestlebridge and our supply routes, they will think twice before they strike again!'"},
[3466]={"Talk to Dagoras near the gates of Isengard","Defeated half-orc ambushers (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Defeat half-orc ambushers (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Clearing the Way","'Have you dealt with the half-orcs yet?'","Dagoras is encamped near the gates of Isengard.\
\
You should return to Dagoras with news of your success.","There are half-orcs along the road to Isengard.\
\
Dagoras has asked you to defeat the half-orcs waiting in ambush for Grimbold's emissary.","Grimbold has sent an emissary Orthanc to demand an explanation from Saruman for his interference in matters between Rohan and Dunland. Unfortunately, there are a number of half-orcs lurking along the road to Isengard, awaiting the chance to waylay such an emissary.","'Good work, ${PLAYER}! It appears that Grimbold's man should make it through to Isengard, but he will face a far greater danger when he approaches the gate itself. If rumour is to be believed, Saruman's voice has the power to bewitch those who hear it.\
\
'Take care of yourself, ${PLAYER}... though I am certain that you already know the danger.'","'Hearken to me, ${PLAYER}. One of Théodred's men, by Grimbold's command, is on his way to parley at the gates of Isengard. It would seem that Saruman would prefer to avoid this meeting, as there is a band of particularly unsavoury half-orcs skulking along the road.\
\
'You should clear the way for the emissary, for I would also like to hear what Saruman has to say for himself when confronted.'"},
[3468]={"Captain Hanâbu needs your assistance clearing the path for the incoming army.\
\
You should complete 'Clearing the Way: Assault on Jolakhúro' and 'Clearing the Way: Ordâkhai Obstacles'.","Talk to Captain Hanâbu","'The Ordâkhai are in disarray! Excellent work. Our forces should be able to mop up the rest as they march toward the gates of Emax Dûl.\
\
'Shâra Mizâdi came through with her Subuzûri while you were at the camp. They intend to take control of this side of the bridge to Emax Dûl. You should go ahead and see if she needs your help. It should be just up this road.'","You have done much to clear the path to Emax Dûl.\
\
You should talk to Captain Hanâbu outside Jolakhúro.","'Even if we cannot be sure that Kotráka Saiya's help will turn the tide of the coming battle in our favour, the time to act is now. Góramul Sai knows we are here, and will attack Ahâba again unless we can push him into a defensive position in his fortress. You will begin that push.\
\
'There is an Ordâkhai camp between here and Emax Dûl called Jolakhúro. I want you and Captain Hanâbu to attack it. This will both force them to retreat behind their walls, and clear the road for the rest of our troops to get into position to siege the city.\
\
'The Captain has already left with enough Aradûni to attack the camp. Meet him there. I will learn what I can from Kotráka Saiya, and our strategy will be set in motion.'","Clearing the Way","The time has come to put Mizâdi's strategy into action. The first step is to clear the way to Emax Dûl.","Complete 'Clearing the Way: Ordâkhai Obstacles'","Captain Hanâbu has gone ahead to attack the Ordâkhai forward camp, Jolakhúro.\
\
You should meet up with Captain Hanâbu outside Jolakhúro.","Meet Mizâdi at the bridge to Emax Dûl","'Ah, the hero of Esh Mêkag has arrived! I look forward to fighting by your side! Scout Arâniz told me everything. There is no need to be modest, you did a great good freeing all those prisoners from that horrible place!\
\
'Now, let us turn to the battle at hand. We must dismantle this camp and clear the road for our forces.'","'They were no match for the Subuzûri. We now hold this side of the bridge, but we do not want the Ordâkhai to know this quite yet. Our plan depends on it.'","Complete 'Clearing the Way: Assault on Jolakhúro'","Mizâdi has gone ahead with her Subuzûri to claim the bridge to Emax Dûl.\
\
You should meet Mizâdi just up the road from Jolakhúro.","Talk to Captain Hanâbu outside Jolakhúro"},
[3469]={"Talk to Captain Hanâbu","Defeat Ordâkhai in Jolakhúro (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Defeat Orihóta Bóro","'Excellent work, ${PLAYER}. My soldiers can take care of any stragglers.'","Defeated Orihóta Bóro","Clearing the Way: Assault on Jolakhúro","'This Ordâkhai camp is quite defensible, but they seem to have let their guard down. They were unprepared for my soldier's assault, and their leader has retreated into the collapsed mine in the camp's rear. Enter the camp, and help us clear it out.'","Defeated Ordâkhai in Jolakhúro (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","The Ordâkhai forward camp needs to be cleared before Mizâdi's forces can move into position outside Emax Dûl.","The Ordâkhai in Jolakhúro have been defeated.\
\
You should return to Captain Hanâbu.","The Ordâkhai camp, Jolakhúro, must be cleared in preparation for the arrival of Mizâdi's allied forces.\
\
You should help the Aradûni soldiers defeat the Ordâkhai and their leader, Orihóta Bóro."},
[3471]={"'Outside Seregost guarded by Blight Lady's children. Know about them? Merrevail, they called. Most dangerous thing in swamp. Maybe. Smarter than Orcs and can fly! Better be careful.'","Defeat Stained merrevail (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Clearing the Yard","Completado.","Stained merrevail can be found near Seregost.\
\
You should defeat any Stained merrevail you find.","The merrevail guarding the front of Seregost have been vanquished. If these are truly the children of Lhaereth the Stained, you wonder what manner of creature she is and if she has more ghastly children awaiting you inside.","Viznak has mentioned that the area near Seregost is heavily patrolled by Lhaereth's children: the Merrevail. You should defeat any you encounter.","Defeated Stained merrevail (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[3472]={"Los materiales originalmente usados para fabricar las lámparas de los enanos se han agotado hace mucho tiempo. Se deben encontrar más si las salas de Moria han de brillar una vez más.","'Los trasgos siguen rompiendo las lámparas de los enanos. Sin ellas, no podemos movernos con seguridad por las salas ni transportar provisiones de un campamento a otro en Khazad-dûm.\
\
'Tenemos que encontrar más materiales para fabricar más lámparas o encontrar un reemplazo. Lo segundo puede ser más fácil, ahora que lo pienso. Creo que podemos usar trozos de patas de araña de cristal para reemplazar los cristales. Para hacer esto, sin embargo, necesitaré muchas de esas patas.\
\
'Si quieres, ve a cazar algunas arañas de cristal y tráeme sus patas. Puedes encontrar muchas de estas bestias al oeste, cerca del Palacio Perdido.'","Habla con Thrand en la Bodega Putrefacta","Las arañas de cristal se encuentran al oeste de la Bodega Putrefacta, cerca del Palacio Perdido.\
\
Thrand quiere reparar algunas de las lámparas de los enanos destrozadas por los trasgos y especula que las patas de araña de cristal serán el mejor reemplazo para los cristales.","Un problema claro","Patas de araña de cristal recogidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Thrand se encuentra en la Bodega Putrefacta, al este del Palacio Perdido.\
\
Thrand estará encantado de ver el estado de las patas de araña de cristal que has recogido.","'Sí, viendo estas, pueden servir como un reemplazo de mala calidad. Gracias por no romperlas en demasiados pedazos.'","'No creo que podamos arreglar las lámparas de los enanos sin esas patas de araña de cristal. No te demores más.'","Recoge patas de araña de cristal (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[3473]={"Complete 'Borrowing Barricades'","'${PLAYER}, the time has come to make a decisive strike against our enemies.\
\
'To the west and south, Orcs have set up their camps and intend to starve us out as more forces of Mordor pour in from the East. We cannot allow this to happen.\
\
'I want you to travel to these camps and raze them. If we can eliminate the Orcs that already seek shelter in our lands, we will be much less ill-prepared to deal with the arrival of new foes.\
\
'Make haste... every passing minute brings more Orcs in the Sutcrofts. Their camps must burn or all will be lost.'","'You have done what I thought impossible, ${PLAYER}.\
\
'The Orcs may still pose a threat to us, but they will no longer lurk just outside our homes.\
\
'We will strengthen our defences at the East Wall and block as many of their number as we can from invading our lands.'","Winsig has directed you to assault the Orc camps to the south-west and west of Walstow.","Complete 'Crippling The Front'","Talk to Winsig","Winsig has expressed concern that the Orc camps near Walstow will soon pose too great a threat along with the Orcs entering through the East Wall. She wishes you to completely dismantle their fortifications so that Walstow can redouble its efforts on a single force.","Cleft In Twain","Complete 'A Controlled Pyre'","Complete 'Circling The Kill'","As you've completely destroyed the Orc fortifications, you should now return to Winsig with news of your victory.\
\
Winsig can be found in the mead-hall of Walstow.","Complete 'A Cut Above'"},
[3475]={"Sháwat can be found somewhere inside Utterby.\
\
You should challenge and defeat Sháwat.","Bakhíl is defeated!","Challenge and defeat Bakhíl","'Good, good! Jáldor was a fool, and I am glad to be rid of him. Report to Yólkhon. If you can complete his tasks, I may tell you who next you can challenge.'","'Ah, here is my busy little Chayasír. I hear more good things from Yólkhon. How would you like to climb the ladder higher? Go find Sháwat and challenge him. I do not think he will be much trouble for you.'","\\qHelp\\q Yólkhon with 'Loosen their Shackles'","'Chayasír, Otkóz tells me you have helped us prepare Er Shamol for an attack. This is good. We should be able to hold off the dwarves now. As a reward for your hard work, I will tell you the name of the Man you must defeat next: Bakhíl. He is known to be dishonourable in duels, so consider yourself warned! I would hate to lose my pet Chayasír now.'","'You surprise me, Chayasír. I did not know your kind had such martial prowess. Report to Otkóz now. He will have more work for you.'","Kunchat is pleased with your prowess in duels.\
\
You should talk to Kunchat.","Bakhíl can be found somewhere inside Utterby.\
\
You should challenge and defeat Bakhíl.","\\qHelp\\q Otkóz with 'Defensive Damage'","Kunchat may let you challenge another Jangovar leader as you earn his favour.\
\
You should complete more quests in Utterby.","\\qHelp\\q Yólkhon with 'Lest They Fall Victim'","Talk to Kunchat","Kunchat is ready to give you the name of another Jangovar to challenge.\
\
You should talk to Kunchat.","'A challenger? Good, I was growing bored!'","Help Tuhâl with 'Feeding the Starved'","\\qHelp\\q Otkóz with 'Destructive Disarmament'","'You wish to challenge me, Chayasír? You will end up dead, fool!'","Sháwat is defeated!","Challenge and defeat Jáldor","Jáldor is defeated!","'Haha! Chayasír, I am impressed! I will spread word of your triumphs!'","Climbing the Ladder","Challenge and defeat Sháwat","Kunchat has heard of your victory and wishes to speak with you.\
\
You should talk to Kunchat.","'Kúlkhur tells me you did the tasks you were given without complaint. That is a good start, but how would you like to separate yourself from the rest of the weaklings here? Jangovar prove themselves by defeating their betters in combat. Then they become the betters. If you succeed and climb the ranks, perhaps Akh-gulûkh will notice you. But you must start at the bottom rung of the ladder. Find Jáldor, and challenge him to a duel. If you succeed, perhaps some less menial tasks will open up for you. The duels are not meant to be to the death, but, accidents happen....'\
\
He laughs cruelly.","Jáldor can be found somewhere inside Utterby.\
\
You should challenge and defeat Jáldor.","'A Chayasír weakling challenges me? I will break your bones!'","Help Tuhâl with 'Bolstering the Feeble'","The Jangovar climb ranks by beating their betters in combat. Perhaps if you are able to defeat some of them yourself, the Jangovar will look upon you favourably."},
[3476]={"Odovacar Bolger está en su casa, en lo alto de la colina que está en el centro de Bolgovado.\
\
Odovacar Bolger te envió a buscar señales del Jinete Negro, pero todo lo que has encontrado es una capa negra arruinada. Deberías traer la capa negra a Odovacar.","'¿No pudiste encontrar ninguna señal de ese \\qJinete Negro\\q?'","Trae la capa negra a Odovacar Bolger","'Quiero que encuentres a ese tipo de la túnica negra y descubras qué está pasando, ${PLAYER}. Lo vieron siendo perseguido por lobos en los campos de Cam Barroso, al este de Bolgovado.'","Odovacar Bolger te ha enviado a perseguir al supuesto Jinete Negro que ha estado rondando sus pocilgas por la noche.","'¡Ja! Esa es sin duda una capa del tamaño de un hobbit. Debió engancharse mientras huía.\
\
'No te preocupes por perder su rastro. ¡Pronto lo atraparemos!'","Busca señales del \\qJinete Negro\\q","'Cam Barroso acaba de decirme que uno de sus ayudantes vio a ese supuesto Jinete Negro dirigiéndose hacia el este, a pie. Ni rastro de caballo, ni siquiera de un poney.\
\
'Cam dice que lo vieron corriendo por unos campos suyos, perseguido por lobos. Ya es bastante tener que lidiar con molestias como estos \\qJinetes Negros\\q, ¿y ahora también debemos preocuparnos por los lobos?\
\
'Si ese tipo acaba siendo devorado por lobos, nunca sabré qué está pasando aquí, así que será mejor que hagas algo al respecto. Ve a los campos de Cam Barroso, al este de Bolgovado, y busca cualquier señal de ese \\qJinete Negro\\q.'","Capa del Jinete Negro","El \\qJinete Negro\\q fue visto en los campos de Cam Barroso, al este de Bolgovado.\
\
Odovacar Bolger te dijo que uno de sus vecinos, Cam Barroso, informó que el Jinete Negro estaba en sus tierras, siendo perseguido por lobos. Odovacar te ha pedido que vayas a buscar al \\qJinete\\q sin caballo."},
[3477]={"From the innumerable beasts you have defeated in Thrór's Coomb, you have managed to obtain a great trophy: Cloben's eye.","'This eye serves as a beacon of hope, friend. With Cloben's defeat, the dwarves have taken their first step towards the reclamation of their home. Your name will be revered among the Longbeards.\
\
'I fear that while this creature was powerful and deadly, it may not be the same beast that has pushed the brood of gwiber out from their mountain home, however....'","With the defeat of Cloben, the dwarves of Thrór's Coomb will no longer have to quake in fear under the threat of the powerful gwiber.\
\
You should bring Cloben's eye to Frithgeir in Zudrugund.","Talk to Frithgeir in Zudrugund","Frithgeir is at Zudrugund, which lies within Nár's Peak, north of the river.\
\
The eye you recovered will long serve as a symbol of the defeat of the gwiber that menaced Thrór's Coomb.","Cloben's Eye"},
[3478]={"Frithgeir is at Zudrugund, which lies within Nár's Peak, north of the river.\
\
The fang you recovered will long serve as a symbol of the defeat of the gwiber that menaced Thrór's Coomb.","'This fang serves as a beacon of hope, friend. With Cloben's defeat, the dwarves have taken their first step towards the reclamation of their home. Your name will be revered among the Longbeards.\
\
'I fear that while this creature was powerful and deadly, it may not be the same beast that has pushed the brood of gwiber out from their mountain home, however....'","From the myriad beasts you have defeated in Thrór's Coomb, you have manage to obtain a great trophy: Cloben's Fang.","With the defeat of Cloben, the dwarves of Thrór's Coomb will no longer have to quake in fear under the threat of the powerful gwiber.\
\
You should bring Cloben's fang to Frithgeir in Zudrugund.","Talk to Frithgeir in Zudrugund","Cloben's Fang"},
[3479]={"'Hay madrigueras de musarañas al este, más allá de los Campos de Cavada. ¡Tienen que cerrarse antes de que las bestias caven más cerca del pueblo!'","La población de musarañas cerca de Cavada Grande ha aumentado enormemente recientemente, y Ruby Piedraprima quiere que los Fronteros hagan algo al respecto.","Ruby Piedraprima está en Cavada Grande, en su casa al sureste de la estatua de Marcho y Blanco en el centro del pueblo.\
\
Ruby estará encantada de saber que has cerrado algunas de las madrigueras de musaraña cerca del pueblo.","Cierra sus madrigueras","'¡Me alegra que ya no tengamos que preocuparnos por esas musarañas excavadoras!'","Cierra las madrigueras de musarañas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'¡Eres justo el tipo de persona que esperaba que apareciera: ${PLAYERNAME:un Frontero[m]|una Frontera[f]}!\
\
Mi hermano en Tejonera es Frontero, así que normalmente le pediría ayuda con esto, pero Tejonera está muy lejos de aquí y realmente quiero que este problema se resuelva lo antes posible.\
\
Hay una terrible plaga de musarañas al este de aquí, más allá de los Campos de Cavada, y están cavando profundamente en la tierra y arruinando la vegetación. Si puedes encontrar algunas de sus madrigueras y cerrarlas, eso debería evitar que esas bestias sucias se acerquen al pueblo. ¡Es tu deber ayudarme con esto, ${PLAYERNAME:Frontero[m]|Frontera[f]}!'","Hay madrigueras de musarañas al este de Cavada Grande, más allá de los Campos de Cavada.\
\
Ruby Piedraprima está molesta por la destrucción de la vegetación causada por las musarañas y quiere que cierres algunas de sus madrigueras.","Madrigueras de musarañas cerradas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'¡Gracias por tu ayuda, ${PLAYERNAME:Frontero[m]|Frontera[f]} ! Eso debería disuadir a las musarañas de cavar cerca del pueblo, al menos por un tiempo.'","'¡Gracias por encargarte del problema de las musarañas!'"},
[3481]={"Pedidos diarios del Gremio de Sastres de Umbar completados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Los sastres abastecen a las masas de Umbar Baharbêl, y tú estás poniendo de tu parte para ayudar.","Vistiendo a Umbar (Semanal)","Completa las cuotas diarias para el Gremio de Sastres de Umbar.","Has completado muchas peticiones de sastre de Umbar.","Completa las peticiones del Gremio de Sastres de Umbar.\
\
Puedes adquirir estas misiones del líder del Gremio de Sastres de Umbar en la sala del gremio de artesanía de Umbar Baharbêl.","Completado","Completa los pedidos diarios del Gremio de Sastres de Umbar (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","¡Has completado muchas entregas de sastre de Umbar!"},
[3482]={"Se pueden encontrar ídolos ardientes en Tham Lorn, en los Campos de Fornost del oeste.\
\
Deberías desactivar los ídolos y detener la corrupción en esta parte de Fornost.","Mincham te espera en su campamento.\
\
Has desactivado muchos de los ídolos ardientes en Tham Lorn, y deberías contarle a Mincham lo que has logrado.","Ídolo nocivo desactivado (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Se pueden encontrar extraños ídolos por todo Tham Lorn, que arrojan nubes verdes nocivas en los Campos de Fornost.","Se pueden encontrar extraños ídolos por todo Tham Lorn, que arrojan nubes verdes nocivas en los Campos de Fornost.\
\
Deberías desactivar los ídolos y detener la propagación de la corrupción desde este lugar maligno.","'Me alegra que hayas podido desactivar esos ídolos, porque creo que ellos, alimentados por la propia Olnathron, han sido responsables del aumento de la corrupción en Fornost últimamente.'","Regresa con Mincham","Desactiva los ídolos ardientes en Tham Lorn","Nubes de corrupción","Desactiva los ídolos ardientes en Tham Lorn (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[3483]={"Clovengap mist-stalkers and sabre-tooth cats can be found in the vineyards in eastern Clovengap.\
\
Mother Amma has asked you to look into whether the Angmarim have managed to corrupt the sabre-tooth cats that prowl Maranazhâr.","Clovengap Mist-walkers","This appears to be an account of the sorceress Iuvár's attempts at using the crystals on the sabre-tooth cats of Clovengap.\
\
'We are being sent back to the vineyards with more crystals. Bruidalg insists I keep trying, no matter how many of my underlings the blasted cats devour. He gave me an adjustment to the ritual at least, so perhaps this time we shall have more luck.'\
\
As you flip through the pages, a familiar looking piece of torn paper flutters loose.","'Aye, I have seen the creatures of which you speak. They glide in and out of the mists like unholy shadows, striking with talons and fangs the size of my arms! Be careful if you go pursuing those cats. You will find them north of here, among the crumbling arches of the old vineyards.'","Deadly sabre-cats prowl the Maranazhâr vineyards in eastern Clovengap.\
\
Look for more clues as to whether the Angmarim have managed to corrupt the sabre-tooth cats.","'The journal you found is full of the rantings of a mad man. It will take me some time to unravel what he has been up to, but I was able to make out that he has been placing more of his crystals around other creatures in the Gap, in hopes of afflicting them with the same power and madness.'\
\
She shows you a page of the book.\
\
'Look here. That is no Warg, but a sabre-tooth! ${PLAYER}, you must find the crystals and destroy them. We need not make sword-mouthed cats even more dangerous. Speak to Nósni, about where the beasts are lurking.'","The Angmarim experiments were going to take place in the vineyards.\
\
With the Angmarim sorceress Iuvár defeated, you should look for clues about their experiments.","A tumbled waggon!","Talk to Nósni","Mother Amma is in Hagbuth, in south-eastern Clovengap.\
\
You should tell Mother Amma what you found in the vineyards.","Drained crystals, and a dead Angmarim","In the crumbling vineyards of Maranazhâr, you have discovered an Angmarim waggon.\
\
The Angmarim have intentions of creating abominations out of the already fierce sabre-tooth cats! You should defeat the Angmarim!","Busca pistas","Search for signs of corruption","Another journal!","Continue searching for signs of corruption","Beneath the crumbling arches of ancient vineyards prowls a deadly beast. Has the corruption of the sarrowstones spread to this already formidable foe?","Examine the waggon","Return to Mother Amma","The waggon was carrying crystals!","Nósni is located in Hagbuth.\
\
Mother Amma has asked you to speak to Nósni.","'¿Qué has encontrado?'"},
[3484]={"Defeat Muzhudh","Precious timber awaits those who brave the hidden dangers of the ethereal crevasse of Clovengap.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Warning: This quest has a one hour time limit. The timer will begin upon accepting the quest.</rgb>","'Careful now, on your journeys.'","Clovengap: Terror in the Trees","You should return to Zádokh Flint-eye and apprise him of your efforts.","You ran out of time...","Defeated Ilvind","Defeated Muzhudh","'Hidden within the crevasse of Clovengap is the precious resource of lumber. The journey there is not an easy one, however, we need the lumber there for our restoration efforts. Are you willing to take on this task?'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Warning: This quest has a one hour time limit. The timer will begin upon accepting the quest. This quest can be completed with one or two adventurers.</rgb>","Defeat Ilvind or Muzhudh.","Talk to Zádokh Flint-eye","'What is this? You have slain a vicious beast of the Clovengap? I praise you for your efforts and your talents, ${CLASS}.'","Defeat Ilvind"},
[3485]={"Collect logs (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Precious timber awaits those who brave the hidden dangers of the ethereal crevasse of Clovengap.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Warning: This quest requires Clovengap: Terror in the Trees to be underway. If that quest has been completed or failed, you will be unable to exit and re-enter this instance in order to complete this quest.</rgb>","Collected logs (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Clovengap: Valuable Resource","The scout gives you a missive to collect logs.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Warning: This quest requires Clovengap: Terror in the Trees to be underway. If that quest has been completed or failed, you will be unable to exit and re-enter this instance in order to complete this quest.</rgb>","Collect logs."},
[3486]={"Defeat wargs or drakes.","Dragonzuelos derrotados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","The scout gives you a missive to defeat wargs or drakes.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Warning: This quest requires Clovengap: Terror in the Trees to be underway. If that quest has been completed or failed, you will be unable to exit and re-enter this instance in order to complete this quest.</rgb>","Huargos derrotados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Precious timber awaits those who brave the hidden dangers of the ethereal crevasse of Clovengap.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Warning: This quest requires Clovengap: Terror in the Trees to be underway. If that quest has been completed or failed, you will be unable to exit and re-enter this instance in order to complete this quest.</rgb>","Derrota huargos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Derrota a los dragonzuelos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Clovengap: Vicious Claws"},
[3488]={"Las cajas de carbón pueden encontrarse en las forjas de Uzbad-bakân, en Zelem-melek.\
\
Deberías destruir las cajas de carbón para frenar la fabricación de armas y armaduras para los orcos de Moria.","Destruye las cajas de carbón","Has descubierto las forjas de Uzbad-bakân, unas instalaciones formidables para la creación de armas y armaduras. El combustible para los hornos debe ser destruido cuanto antes.","Destruye las cajas de carbón (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Has destruido el carbón que iba a alimentar las forjas de Uzbad-bakân, frenando así la fabricación de armas y armaduras para los orcos de Moria.","Caja de carbón destruida (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Completado","Carbón para los hornos"},
[3490]={"'Ah, has traído todo lo que te pedí. Bien.\
\
'Ahora confeccionaré algo valioso con estas bestias viles que nos han causado tanto sufrimiento.'","'Gracias, pequeño ${RACE}, por matar a los huargos. Comeremos mejor gracias a ello.'","Tanto los Huargos funestos como la hierba de túmulo pueden encontrarse en las llanuras orientales de Nan Amlug.\
\
Para fabricar una armadura para los Suuri-lehmä, Mauno te ha pedido que recojas pieles de Huargos funestos y algo de hierba de túmulo.","Pieles de Huargo funesto reunidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Durante mucho tiempo pensamos que el pelaje de los huargos no servía. Se pudre demasiado rápido al morir. Pero hemos descubierto que puede curarse con una mezcla sencilla de hierba de túmulo, una planta amarga que crece en las llanuras cercanas.\
\
'Si me traes pieles de Huargo funesto y algo de hierba de túmulo, quizás pueda confeccionar una armadura con ellas. Los huargos merodean por las llanuras del este.\
\
'Las pieles oscuras de los huargos temibles podrían servir para fabricar una armadura que nos permita ocultarnos mejor de los Rauta-lehmä y los Angmarim.'","'Espero las pieles de huargo y la hierba de túmulo que te pedí. Ambas pueden encontrarse en las tierras cercanas.'","Reúne hierba de túmulo (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Hierba de túmulo reunida (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Lleva los objetos que has reunido a Mauno","Mauno está en el campamento de los Suuri-lehmä.\
\
Has reunido suficientes pieles de huargo y la hierba de túmulo que Mauno necesita para curarlas. Deberías llevárselas lo antes posible.","Los Hijos de la Tierra solían creer que las pieles de los Huargos eran completamente inútiles, pero recientemente han descubierto una forma de curarlas.","'Tráeme hierba de túmulo y pieles de huargo, y te haré una armadura.'","Manto de Sombras","'La armadura que haremos con tus presas, ${PLAYER}, será una bendición para los Suuri-lehmä.'","Reúne pieles de Huargo funesto (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[3492]={"¡Has descubierto el Campamento de los Cazatesoros!","Colbert el Cazatesoros","Colbert te ha hablado finalmente de su pasado, y de un campamento de cazadores de tesoros en las proximidades de la vieja ciudad de Fornost.","'¡Hola! Así que lo has conseguido, ¿no es así?'","Habla con Colbert","Encuentra el Campamento de los Cazatesoros","El Campamento de los Cazatesoros se encuentra dentro de las puertas de la ciudad de Fornost, al suroeste de la ciudad propiamente dicha, lejos hacia el norte en los Campos de Fornost.\
\
Debes encontrar el Campamento de los Cazatesoros y encontrarte allí con Colbert.","Colbert está en el Campamento de Cazatesoros al norte de Fornost.\
\
Debes hablar con Colbert.","'¡Ah, sabía que lo conseguirías! Te puede la curiosidad y no te quedas al margen de nada, ¿verdad?\
\
'Bueno, esta es nuestra pequeña banda. La gente que se ha reunido en la fortaleza está dándole al coco para elaborar planes serios. Yo prefiero estar por aquí, donde la gente sensaba piensa en cómo sobrevivir. Este no es precisamente el más acogedor de los lugares.'","'¿Te gustaría explorar la ciudad de Fornost? Podríamos ver si mis viejos compañeros siguen allí. La última vez que los vi, habían acampado pasadas las puertas, al suroeste de la ciudad.\
\
'Podríamos encontrarnos allí. Creo que volveré para reunirme con ellos. Mincham es un buen tipo, pero un poco serio para mí.'"},
[3493]={"Invoca y derrota a Delucheleg","Frío como la muerte","'¿Un servidor de Angmar? ¿Aquí, sobre el propio jätikkö? Los Ancianos se enfurecerán al saber que los Rauta-väki ya han extendido sus manos tan profundamente en nuestras tierras.\
\
'Gracias por tu ayuda. Si Nicca estaba en lo cierto y esa criatura era quien alzaba a los Râto, quizá pronto la mâginen oscura se disipe y dejen de atormentar Kibilzahar.\
\
'Permíteme entregarte este obsequio por todo lo que has hecho. Debo partir pronto para informar al Consejo de Ancianos de lo sucedido aquí.'","'Delucheleg es muy antiguo y muy malvado… ten cuidado con su poder.'","Has derrotado a Delucheleg","Arre se encuentra en Kuru-leiri, al sureste de Kibilzahar.\
\
Tras haber derrotado a Delucheleg, el Hombre demacrado responsable de alzar a los espectros, deberías regresar con Arre y contarle tus descubrimientos y combates.","Nicca te ha hablado de los espíritus crueles que vagan por el glaciar y de la criatura que los convoca, sepultándolos en los cuerpos congelados de Hombres para que sirvan como guerreros oscuros.","'Los espíritus crueles de Kibilzahar traen consigo el frío y el hielo, y lo convierten en un lugar terrible. Debes llevar calor y fuego a ese lugar de piedra, frío y desolado.\
\
'Hubo un tiempo, cuando los Kivi-väki estaban allí, en que había calor. Encendían grandes fuegos para calentar incluso la piedra. Así debes actuar tú para expulsar a los espíritus. Pero te advierto: hay un oscuro manâja oculto allí. Es él quien comanda a los espíritus, y no tolerará el fuego. No debes subestimar a este enemigo, o tú también morirás allí, convertido en un cadáver helado que camina.\
\
'Ahora vete. Este no es lugar para ti. Es mío, y aquí moriré solo cuando llegue mi hora.'","Kibilzahar se encuentra al noroeste de Kuru-leiri.\
\
Nicca te dijo que un poder maligno ha atrapado espíritus crueles dentro de los cuerpos de los espectros en Kibilzahar. Solo el calor del fuego puede expulsarlos. Te ha pedido que reavives los fuegos antiguos que los enanos usaban antaño para calentar la vieja fortaleza. También te advirtió de un señor maligno que acecha ese lugar y de que te prepares para enfrentarte a él si regresas allí.","Habla con Arre en Kuru-leiri"},
[3494]={"Cold as Ice","Wintry Weather can be found to the north-east of Winter-home.\
\
Daley Utteridge wants you to help the less fortunate of Winter-home by driving off the harsh cold that accompanied the arrival of frost grims in Frostbluff.","Dispersed Wintry Weather (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Daley Utteridge is concerned for the well-being of the less fortunate and wants you to drive off the frost grims that have appeared in Frostbluff.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> NOTE: This quest will be removed from your quest log when the current festival ends. </rgb>","Daley Utteridge is in Winter-home.\
\
You should return to Daley Utteridge with news of your success.","Talk to Daley Utteridge","'I can still feel their unnatural chill from here. Please, ${PLAYER}, drive the grims off...I worry for my friends.'","Disperse Wintry Weather (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'I cannot believe it, ${PLAYER}. Guard Kember and the watchmen have been making an effort to keep those less fortunate from the festivities, but I never thought that some of our own patrons would drive them out!\
\
'Where will they go? I'm sure a few will sneak back in, but it has only gotten tougher for them as of late. The harsh chill of frost grims has taken hold of Frostbluff, and I fear for those that are forced outside the walls of Winter-home.\
\
'Please, ${PLAYER}, can you help them? I can't stop working for fear of losing my wages, but maybe you can do something about those grims. I've seen them gathering at the frozen pond north-east of here, and it's only a matter of time before they move closer. Drive them off! My friends depend upon it!'","'Thank you, ${PLAYER}. I will be able to rest easier knowing my friends are safe from the bite of winter, even just for tonight. If those grims return, I may ask for your help again.'"},
[3495]={"'¿Qué necesitas?'","Lleva el collar de hierro a Ovorlas","Ovorlas está en el campamento élfico en el extremo norte de Nen Hilith.\
\
Debes llevar el collar a Ovorlas y ver si significa algo para él.","Con Collar","'Conozco este trabajo. Es obra de trasgos. Debemos informar a los demás en Celondim. ¡Si los trasgos se han vuelto tan agresivos, debemos hacer lo que podamos para expulsarlos de nuestros hogares!'","Descubriste un tosco collar de hierro en el cuello de un lobo en el valle de Nen Hilith. Es posible que el collar brinde información sobre el problema que ha surgido allí.","Al observar de cerca este tosco collar, puedes ver que no es obra de Elfos ni de enanos.\
\
Quizás Ovorlas pueda obtener alguna información del collar. Debes entregárselo en el campamento élfico en el extremo norte de Nen Hilith."},
[3496]={"'Alas, you are correct, I fear. These wild cats are not at all wild. They have been trained in the art of war.\
\
'This collar is of Easterling design, and no doubt belongs to the Khundolar.'","Bring the collar you found to Twiga at Etheburg in the Brown Lands","Twiga is at Etheburg in the Brown Lands.\
\
You should bring this collar to Twiga at once.","'¿Tienes algo para mí?'","You found this collar upon one of the wild cats that roam the Brown Lands. Its intricate design is unlike any you have seen before.\
\
Regardless, it is a sign that the cats are not native to the region. Twiga will want to know of this.","You found a collar upon one of the wild cats of the Brown Lands. The intricate designs are not familiar to you.","Collared Cats"},
[3498]={"'¡Has regresado! ¡Excelente! Los granjeros estarán contentos de que hayas ayudado en sus campos y ahora los dedos de los pies de todos estarán más seguros.'","Aves molestas se han convertido en una plaga en los campos de Lintrev.","Recolecta alas de Crébain (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Regresa con Adan","Adan Rhuvyg te ha pedido que recolectes alas de Crébain en los huertos de Lintrev.\
\
Lintrev está en el Valle de los Fuertes.","Recolectando Alas de Crébain","'¡Oh, hola! ¡Eres ${PLAYERNAME:nuevo[m]|nueva[f]} aquí, ¿verdad?! Tienes ese aire de ${PLAYERNAME:aventurero[m]|aventurera[f]}, y gente como tú siempre parece estar buscando trabajos para ganar unas monedas extra. ¡Pues tengo tanto monedas como trabajo, si estás dispuesto!\
\
'Los huertos están infestados por aves molestas parecidas a cuervos. Son muy extrañas, se comen todas las semillas y ¡picotean tus dedos si intentas espantarlas! Elimínalas, pero tráeme sus alas. Deseo estudiarlas en detalle.'","Deberías llevar las alas de Crébain a Adan Rhuvyg.\
\
Adan está en Lintrev.","Alas de Crébain recolectadas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[3499]={"'¡Saludos de nuevo, ${PLAYER}! He estado estudiando los materiales que me trajiste de las Quebradas de los Túmulos y he aprendido mucho más desde la última vez que hablamos.\
\
Me gustaría pedirte un último Favor. el diario que encontraste para mí contiene una gran cantidad de conocimientos. a través de él, he aprendido que Los hombres de Cardolan enterraban muchas reliquias con sus muertos; puede que algunas de estas cosas puedan ayudarnos a defendernos contra criaturas como los tumularios. \
\
El diario habla de cálices que fueron enterrados en el Gran Túmulo. me pregunto si podrías ir allí y recoger algunos para mí. estoy seguro de que hay muchos de ellos en las catacumbas del Gran Túmulo.'","'Parece que los cálices tenían algo de valor después de todo, ${PLAYER}. ¡Gracias por traérmelos!'","Investigaciones históricas","'¡Confieso que tenía medio miedo de que no volvieras! ¿Has encontrado los cálices? ¡Ah, maravilloso!\
\
No puedo decir que estos nos ayuden en absoluto contra criaturas tan temibles como los tumularios, pero podrían tener algún valor, ¡estrictamente histórico, por supuesto! Los llevaré de inmediato a alguien que podría encontrarlos interesantes.'","'Muchas personas se interesan por esos cálices... ¡Estas investigaciones han sido fructíferas!'","'¿Aún no tienes los cálices? Por favor, date prisa. El Gran Túmulo no permanecerá oculto por mucho tiempo. ¡Pronto, estos tesoros de conocimiento se convertirán en los tesoros de los saqueadores de tumbas!'","Recoge cálices antiguos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","El Gran Túmulo se encuentra en el corazón de las Quebradas de los Túmulos, más allá de el Alto del Hombre Muerto, en el sur de las Quebradas de los Túmulos.\
\
Tobold cortahoja te ha pedido que vayas a recoger cálices Antiguos del Gran Túmulo, situado en el corazón de las Quebradas de los Túmulos.","Tobold Cortahoja ha oído hablar de antiguas reliquias que los Hombres de Cardolan enterraban con sus muertos en las Quebradas de los Túmulos y que parecían servir para repeler a los tumularios.","Devuelve los cálices antiguos a Tobold Cortahoja","Cáliz antiguo recogido (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
}
